window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/b002-39a11bee1afa5c2f.json"]={sha256:"39a11bee1afa5c2f00b20eca04401ab8127acf3c890173b4059e343ed46a2306",value:{"id":"b002","title":"金門大橋（金門）","titleEn":"Kinmen Bridge","category":"structures","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"金門大橋跨越金烈水道連接大金門與小金門，全長約 5.4 公里，主橋為五塔六跨預力箱梁脊背橋，最大跨徑 200 公尺。本課從海況與荷載出發，拆解脊背索的受力分工、花崗片麻岩中的大口徑基樁、鋼箱圍堰樁帽、興達港預鑄節塊的海運與懸臂吊裝、索力量測與載重試驗，最後談海洋耐久與營運交接。","summaryEn":"Kinmen Bridge crosses the Kinmen–Lieyu channel between Greater and Lesser Kinmen; the route is about 5.4 km long and the main bridge is a five-tower, six-span prestressed box-girder extradosed bridge with a longest span of 200 m. Starting from sea conditions and loads, the course unpacks how extradosed stays share load, large-diameter piles in granitic gneiss, steel box cofferdam pile caps, sea transport and cantilever erection of segments precast at Hsing-ta Harbour, stay-force measurement and load testing, and finally marine durability and operational handover.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、吊裝或張拉作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, lifting or stressing permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"st-arch-viaduct-sea","subcategoryTitle":"拱橋、高架橋與跨海通道","subcategoryTitleEn":"Arch bridges, viaducts and sea crossings","learningTrack":"structures","learningSubdiscipline":"st-arch-viaduct-sea","learningTags":["structures","st-arch-viaduct-sea","viaduct"],"architectureFamily":"viaduct","architectureNodes":[["全套管基樁與鋼箱圍堰樁帽","Cased piles and cofferdam pile caps"],["墩柱與低矮橋塔","Piers and low towers"],["脊背索與錨碇","Extradosed stays and anchorages"],["預鑄預力箱梁節塊","Precast prestressed box segments"],["支承與伸縮縫","Bearings and expansion joints"],["量測、監測與維護紀錄","Measurement, monitoring and records"]],"architectureEdges":[[3,2],[2,1],[3,4],[4,1],[1,0],[2,5],[4,5]],"diagram":{"type":"viaduct","labels":["全套管基樁與鋼箱圍堰樁帽","墩柱與低矮橋塔","脊背索與錨碇","預鑄預力箱梁節塊","支承與伸縮縫"],"labelsEn":["Cased piles and cofferdam pile caps","Piers and low towers","Extradosed stays and anchorages","Precast prestressed box segments","Bearings and expansion joints"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"設計練習：一個 200 m 跨的脊背橋跨，箱梁恆載 w = 300 kN/m，假設脊背索承擔 30% 的恆載，每跨共 16 根索。索承擔的總垂直力 = 300×200×0.3 = 18,000 kN，每根 V = 18,000/16 = 1,125 kN。索角 20° 時索力 T = V/sin20° = 1,125/0.342 ≈ 3,289 kN，送入箱梁的水平壓力 H = T·cos20° ≈ 3,091 kN。單股 15.2 mm 鋼絞線面積 140 mm²、f_pu = 1,860 MPa：以 0.6 f_pu = 1,116 MPa 計需 3,289,000/(1,116×140) ≈ 21.1，取 22 股；若因應力幅大改用 0.45 f_pu = 837 MPa，需約 28.1，取 29 股。若把索角提高到 25°，T ≈ 2,662 kN，以 0.6 f_pu 計只需約 17.0，取 18 股，但橋塔要更高。數值為教學假設，不代表金門大橋的設計。","textEn":"Design exercise: a 200 m extradosed span has a girder dead load w = 300 kN/m, and the stays are assumed to carry 30% of it with 16 stays per span. The total vertical stay force is 300×200×0.3 = 18,000 kN, so each stay carries V = 18,000/16 = 1,125 kN. At 20° the stay force is T = V/sin20° = 1,125/0.342 ≈ 3,289 kN and the horizontal compression into the girder is H = T·cos20° ≈ 3,091 kN. With 15.2 mm strands of 140 mm² and f_pu = 1,860 MPa, 0.6 f_pu = 1,116 MPa needs 3,289,000/(1,116×140) ≈ 21.1, so 22 strands; if a large stress range forces 0.45 f_pu = 837 MPa, about 28.1 are needed, so 29 strands. Raising the angle to 25° gives T ≈ 2,662 kN and only about 17.0, so 18 strands, at 0.6 f_pu, but the towers must be taller. Values are teaching assumptions, not the design of Kinmen Bridge.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":13,"enrichmentVersion":13,"stages":[{"id":"b002-v13-s1","title":"工程背景、荷載與結構系統","titleEn":"Context, loads and structural system","description":"本階段聚焦「金烈水道海況與荷載組合」與「五塔六跨脊背橋的受力分工」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Channel conditions and load cases\" and \"Load sharing in the five-tower extradosed bridge\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b002-v13-01","title":"金烈水道海況與荷載組合：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Channel conditions and load cases: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「深槽區鋼套管」如何影響金門大橋（金門）的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Deep-channel steel casing” governs force, deformation or durability in “Kinmen Bridge”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"金門大橋跨越金烈水道，深槽區水深約 22 至 23 公尺，最大潮差約 6 公尺，海流可達約 1.6 m/s，冬季有東北季風、春季有濃霧、夏秋有颱風。對基礎與施工臨時結構而言，海流拖曳力、波浪力與潮位變化同時作用；對上部結構則以颱風風壓、地震與溫度為主。設計時要把永久狀態（營運、地震、颱風、船舶撞擊）與施工狀態（鋼套管、作業平台、懸臂）的荷載組合分開列出，因為施工中的臨時結構常比完工結構更脆弱，而且暴露在海上的時間以年計。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「深槽區鋼套管」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Kinmen Bridge crosses the Kinmen–Lieyu channel, where the deep trough is about 22 to 23 m deep, the maximum tidal range is about 6 m and currents reach about 1.6 m/s, with the northeast monsoon in winter, fog in spring and typhoons in summer and autumn. Foundations and temporary works feel current drag, wave forces and tide changes at the same time, while the superstructure is governed by typhoon wind, earthquake and temperature. Design must list permanent states (service, earthquake, typhoon, ship impact) separately from construction states (steel casings, work platforms, cantilevers), because temporary structures are often more vulnerable than the finished bridge and stay exposed at sea for years. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Deep-channel steel casing” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：海流拖曳力 F = ½ρ·C_D·D·h·U²。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Current drag F = ½ρ·C_D·D·h·U².","failure":"常見誤解：「海上橋梁的基礎設計只要考慮完工後的營運荷載就足夠。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Designing a marine bridge foundation only needs the in-service loads of the finished bridge.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「深槽區鋼套管」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Deep-channel steel casing”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-01-k1","title":"金烈水道海況與荷載組合","titleEn":"Channel conditions and load cases","text":"金門大橋跨越金烈水道，深槽區水深約 22 至 23 公尺，最大潮差約 6 公尺，海流可達約 1.6 m/s，冬季有東北季風、春季有濃霧、夏秋有颱風。對基礎與施工臨時結構而言，海流拖曳力、波浪力與潮位變化同時作用；對上部結構則以颱風風壓、地震與溫度為主。","textEn":"Kinmen Bridge crosses the Kinmen–Lieyu channel, where the deep trough is about 22 to 23 m deep, the maximum tidal range is about 6 m and currents reach about 1.6 m/s, with the northeast monsoon in winter, fog in spring and typhoons in summer and autumn. Foundations and temporary works feel current drag, wave forces and tide changes at the same time, while the superstructure is governed by typhoon wind, earthquake and temperature.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：海上橋梁的基礎設計只要考慮完工後的營運荷載就足夠。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Designing a marine bridge foundation only needs the in-service loads of the finished bridge. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「金烈水道海況與荷載組合」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Channel conditions and load cases\" is correct?","options":["海上橋梁的基礎設計只要考慮完工後的營運荷載就足夠。","金門大橋跨越金烈水道，深槽區水深約 22 至 23 公尺，最大潮差約 6 公尺，海流可達約 1.6 m/s，冬季有東北季風、春季有濃霧、夏秋有颱風。","脊背橋只是橋塔比較矮的斜張橋，設計方法完全一樣。"],"optionsEn":["Designing a marine bridge foundation only needs the in-service loads of the finished bridge.","Kinmen Bridge crosses the Kinmen–Lieyu channel, where the deep trough is about 22 to 23 m deep, the maximum tidal range is about 6 m and currents reach about 1.6 m/s, with the northeast monsoon in winter, fog in spring and typhoons in summer and autumn.","An extradosed bridge is just a cable-stayed bridge with short towers and is designed the same way."],"answer":1,"explanation":"金門大橋跨越金烈水道，深槽區水深約 22 至 23 公尺，最大潮差約 6 公尺，海流可達約 1.6 m/s，冬季有東北季風、春季有濃霧、夏秋有颱風。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Kinmen Bridge crosses the Kinmen–Lieyu channel, where the deep trough is about 22 to 23 m deep, the maximum tidal range is about 6 m and currents reach about 1.6 m/s, with the northeast monsoon in winter, fog in spring and typhoons in summer and autumn. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b002-v13-02","title":"金烈水道海況與荷載組合：定量估算","titleEn":"Channel conditions and load cases: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「深槽區鋼套管」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Deep-channel steel casing” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：海流拖曳力 F = ½ρ·C_D·D·h·U²。取 ρ = 1,025 kg/m³、C_D = 1.0、外套管直徑 D = 3.0 m、水深 h = 23 m、流速 U = 1.6 m/s，F = 0.5×1,025×1.0×3.0×23×1.6² ≈ 90.5 kN；若合力作用在半水深，海床處彎矩約 90.5×11.5 ≈ 1,041 kN·m。流速加倍時拖曳力變為 4 倍，約 362 kN。C_D、D 與作用點為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Current drag F = ½ρ·C_D·D·h·U². With ρ = 1,025 kg/m³, C_D = 1.0, outer casing diameter D = 3.0 m, water depth h = 23 m and U = 1.6 m/s, F = 0.5×1,025×1.0×3.0×23×1.6² ≈ 90.5 kN; acting at mid-depth it gives a seabed moment of about 90.5×11.5 ≈ 1,041 kN·m. Doubling the velocity quadruples the drag to about 362 kN. C_D, D and the point of action are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以聲學都卜勒流速剖面儀（ADCP）與潮位站資料建立設計流速剖面，套管定位時以 GNSS 與傾斜儀量測位置與垂直度，並比較漲退潮最急時套管頂偏位與計算撓度；作業平台與臨時結構的荷載檢核經工程師簽認後才能使用。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Build the design current profile from acoustic Doppler current profiler (ADCP) surveys and tide-gauge records, measure casing position and verticality with GNSS and inclinometers during placement, and compare casing-top drift at peak flood and ebb with the calculated deflection; platforms and temporary works are used only after their load checks are signed off by an engineer.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"海流拖曳力 F = ½ρ·C_D·D·h·U²。取 ρ = 1,025 kg/m³、C_D = 1.0、外套管直徑 D = 3.0 m、水深 h = 23 m、流速 U = 1.6 m/s，F = 0.5×1,025×1.0×3.0×23×1.6² ≈ 90.5 kN；若合力作用在半水深，海床處彎矩約 90.5×11.5 ≈ 1,041 kN·m。流速加倍時拖曳力變為 4 倍，約 362 kN。C_D、D 與作用點為教學假設。","textEn":"Current drag F = ½ρ·C_D·D·h·U². With ρ = 1,025 kg/m³, C_D = 1.0, outer casing diameter D = 3.0 m, water depth h = 23 m and U = 1.6 m/s, F = 0.5×1,025×1.0×3.0×23×1.6² ≈ 90.5 kN; acting at mid-depth it gives a seabed moment of about 90.5×11.5 ≈ 1,041 kN·m. Doubling the velocity quadruples the drag to about 362 kN. C_D, D and the point of action are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「金烈水道海況與荷載組合」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Channel conditions and load cases\", which statement holds?","options":["鋼箱圍堰只是擋水的模板，抽水時不會產生很大的力。","平衡懸臂工法兩側永遠等重，所以墩柱不會受到彎矩。","海流拖曳力 F = ½ρ·C_D·D·h·U²。"],"optionsEn":["A steel box cofferdam is only a formwork that keeps water out, so dewatering creates no large forces.","In balanced cantilever erection both sides are always equal, so the pier never sees bending.","Current drag F = ½ρ·C_D·D·h·U²."],"answer":2,"explanation":"海流拖曳力 F = ½ρ·C_D·D·h·U²。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Current drag F = ½ρ·C_D·D·h·U². Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b002-v13-03","title":"金烈水道海況與荷載組合：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Channel conditions and load cases: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「深槽區鋼套管」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Deep-channel steel casing” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以聲學都卜勒流速剖面儀（ADCP）與潮位站資料建立設計流速剖面，套管定位時以 GNSS 與傾斜儀量測位置與垂直度，並比較漲退潮最急時套管頂偏位與計算撓度；作業平台與臨時結構的荷載檢核經工程師簽認後才能使用。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Build the design current profile from acoustic Doppler current profiler (ADCP) surveys and tide-gauge records, measure casing position and verticality with GNSS and inclinometers during placement, and compare casing-top drift at peak flood and ebb with the calculated deflection; platforms and temporary works are used only after their load checks are signed off by an engineer. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：海事工程應建立潮流與氣象作業門檻表（流速、風速、浪高、能見度），每日開工前檢核，超過門檻即停止吊裝與定位；颱風警報發布前完成船機撤離與臨時結構加固，並由監造單位確認紀錄。","observationEn":"Site practice: Marine works need an operating-limit table for current, wind, wave height and visibility, checked before each shift, with lifting and positioning stopped when a limit is exceeded; before a typhoon warning, vessels are withdrawn and temporary works secured, with records confirmed by the supervising engineer.","failure":"注意干擾：若以平均流速而非尖峰流速設計臨時套管與平台，漲退潮最急時套管偏移、鑽孔偏斜，樁身垂直度超出容許值，鋼筋籠無法順利下放或基樁偏心受力；颱風來襲前若未撤離施工船機，船舶走錨也可能撞擊已完成的墩柱。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Designing temporary casings and platforms for mean rather than peak current lets the casing drift and the bore wander at peak flow, so pile verticality exceeds tolerance, reinforcement cages cannot be lowered cleanly or the pile is loaded eccentrically; work vessels not withdrawn before a typhoon can drag anchor and strike finished piers. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以聲學都卜勒流速剖面儀（ADCP）與潮位站資料建立設計流速剖面，套管定位時以 GNSS 與傾斜儀量測位置與垂直度，並比較漲退潮最急時套管頂偏位與計算撓度；作業平台與臨時結構的荷載檢核經工程師簽認後才能使用。","textEn":"Build the design current profile from acoustic Doppler current profiler (ADCP) surveys and tide-gauge records, measure casing position and verticality with GNSS and inclinometers during placement, and compare casing-top drift at peak flood and ebb with the calculated deflection; platforms and temporary works are used only after their load checks are signed off by an engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"海事工程應建立潮流與氣象作業門檻表（流速、風速、浪高、能見度），每日開工前檢核，超過門檻即停止吊裝與定位；颱風警報發布前完成船機撤離與臨時結構加固，並由監造單位確認紀錄。","textEn":"Marine works need an operating-limit table for current, wind, wave height and visibility, checked before each shift, with lifting and positioning stopped when a limit is exceeded; before a typhoon warning, vessels are withdrawn and temporary works secured, with records confirmed by the supervising engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「金烈水道海況與荷載組合」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Channel conditions and load cases\"?","options":["以聲學都卜勒流速剖面儀（ADCP）與潮位站資料建立設計流速剖面，套管定位時以 GNSS 與傾斜儀量測位置與垂直度，並比較漲退潮最急時套管頂偏位與計算撓度。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","載重試驗只要撓度小於計算值，就不必再檢查其他量測結果。"],"optionsEn":["Build the design current profile from acoustic Doppler current profiler (ADCP) surveys and tide-gauge records, measure casing position and verticality with GNSS and inclinometers during placement, and compare casing-top drift at peak flood and ebb with the calculated deflection.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","If load-test deflections are below the calculated values, no other measurement needs checking."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以聲學都卜勒流速剖面儀（ADCP）與潮位站資料建立設計流速剖面，套管定位時以 GNSS 與傾斜儀量測位置與垂直度，並比較漲退潮最急時套管頂偏位與計算撓度；作業平台與臨時結構的荷載檢核經工程師簽認後才能使用。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Build the design current profile from acoustic Doppler current profiler (ADCP) surveys and tide-gauge records, measure casing position and verticality with GNSS and inclinometers during placement, and compare casing-top drift at peak flood and ebb with the calculated deflection; platforms and temporary works are used only after their load checks are signed off by an engineer. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b002-v13-04","title":"金烈水道海況與荷載組合：失效診斷","titleEn":"Channel conditions and load cases: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「深槽區鋼套管」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Deep-channel steel casing” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若以平均流速而非尖峰流速設計臨時套管與平台，漲退潮最急時套管偏移、鑽孔偏斜，樁身垂直度超出容許值，鋼筋籠無法順利下放或基樁偏心受力；颱風來襲前若未撤離施工船機，船舶走錨也可能撞擊已完成的墩柱。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Designing temporary casings and platforms for mean rather than peak current lets the casing drift and the bore wander at peak flow, so pile verticality exceeds tolerance, reinforcement cages cannot be lowered cleanly or the pile is loaded eccentrically; work vessels not withdrawn before a typhoon can drag anchor and strike finished piers. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：設計時要把永久狀態（營運、地震、颱風、船舶撞擊）與施工狀態（鋼套管、作業平台、懸臂）的荷載組合分開列出，因為施工中的臨時結構常比完工結構更脆弱，而且暴露在海上的時間以年計。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Design must list permanent states (service, earthquake, typhoon, ship impact) separately from construction states (steel casings, work platforms, cantilevers), because temporary structures are often more vulnerable than the finished bridge and stay exposed at sea for years.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「海上橋梁的基礎設計只要考慮完工後的營運荷載就足夠。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Designing a marine bridge foundation only needs the in-service loads of the finished bridge.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若以平均流速而非尖峰流速設計臨時套管與平台，漲退潮最急時套管偏移、鑽孔偏斜，樁身垂直度超出容許值，鋼筋籠無法順利下放或基樁偏心受力；颱風來襲前若未撤離施工船機，船舶走錨也可能撞擊已完成的墩柱。","textEn":"Designing temporary casings and platforms for mean rather than peak current lets the casing drift and the bore wander at peak flow, so pile verticality exceeds tolerance, reinforcement cages cannot be lowered cleanly or the pile is loaded eccentrically; work vessels not withdrawn before a typhoon can drag anchor and strike finished piers.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「金烈水道海況與荷載組合」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Channel conditions and load cases\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","若以平均流速而非尖峰流速設計臨時套管與平台，漲退潮最急時套管偏移、鑽孔偏斜，樁身垂直度超出容許值，鋼筋籠無法順利下放或基樁偏心受力。","脊背橋只是橋塔比較矮的斜張橋，設計方法完全一樣。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Designing temporary casings and platforms for mean rather than peak current lets the casing drift and the bore wander at peak flow, so pile verticality exceeds tolerance, reinforcement cages cannot be lowered cleanly or the pile is loaded eccentrically.","An extradosed bridge is just a cable-stayed bridge with short towers and is designed the same way."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若以平均流速而非尖峰流速設計臨時套管與平台，漲退潮最急時套管偏移、鑽孔偏斜，樁身垂直度超出容許值，鋼筋籠無法順利下放或基樁偏心受力；颱風來襲前若未撤離施工船機，船舶走錨也可能撞擊已完成的墩柱。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Designing temporary casings and platforms for mean rather than peak current lets the casing drift and the bore wander at peak flow, so pile verticality exceeds tolerance, reinforcement cages cannot be lowered cleanly or the pile is loaded eccentrically; work vessels not withdrawn before a typhoon can drag anchor and strike finished piers. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b002-v13-05","title":"五塔六跨脊背橋的受力分工：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Load sharing in the five-tower extradosed bridge: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-04"],"objective":"說明「脊背索與低矮橋塔」如何影響金門大橋（金門）的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Extradosed stays and low towers” governs force, deformation or durability in “Kinmen Bridge”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"主橋為五塔六跨預力混凝土箱梁脊背橋，跨徑配置為 125 + 4×200 + 125 公尺，主橋長 1,050 公尺。脊背橋介於梁橋與斜張橋之間：橋塔較矮，脊背索以平緩角度錨在箱梁上，作用像體外預力，把水平壓力送入梁內並提供部分垂直支撐，箱梁仍需足夠梁深承擔大部分彎矩。索角平緩使活載造成的索應力幅較小，疲勞要求較寬鬆，部分準則因此允許較高的索應力比例。多塔連續時，中間塔沒有錨碇跨平衡，不對稱活載下要靠箱梁與墩塔勁度控制變形。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「脊背索與低矮橋塔」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The main bridge is a five-tower, six-span prestressed concrete box-girder extradosed bridge with spans of 125 + 4×200 + 125 m and a length of 1,050 m. An extradosed bridge sits between a girder bridge and a cable-stayed bridge: towers are short and stays anchor into the girder at a shallow angle, acting like external prestress that pushes compression into the girder and adds partial vertical support, while the girder still needs enough depth to carry most of the bending. The shallow angle keeps the live-load stress range in the stays small, so fatigue demands are milder and some guidelines allow a higher stress ratio. With several towers in a row, the inner towers have no anchor span to balance them, so girder and tower stiffness must control deformation under unbalanced live load. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Extradosed stays and low towers” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：索力 T = 5,000 kN、索角 20° 時，垂直分量 V = T·sin20° ≈ 1,710 kN，水平壓力 H = T·cos20° ≈ 4,698 kN；斜張橋常見的 35° 則 V ≈ 2,868 kN、H ≈ 4,096 kN。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For a stay force T = 5,000 kN at 20°, the vertical component is V = T·sin20° ≈ 1,710 kN and the horizontal compression H = T·cos20° ≈ 4,698 kN; at a typical cable-stayed angle of 35°, V ≈ 2,868 kN and H ≈ 4,096 kN.","failure":"常見誤解：「脊背橋只是橋塔比較矮的斜張橋，設計方法完全一樣。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"An extradosed bridge is just a cable-stayed bridge with short towers and is designed the same way.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「脊背索與低矮橋塔」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Extradosed stays and low towers”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-05-k1","title":"五塔六跨脊背橋的受力分工","titleEn":"Load sharing in the five-tower extradosed bridge","text":"主橋為五塔六跨預力混凝土箱梁脊背橋，跨徑配置為 125 + 4×200 + 125 公尺，主橋長 1,050 公尺。脊背橋介於梁橋與斜張橋之間：橋塔較矮，脊背索以平緩角度錨在箱梁上，作用像體外預力，把水平壓力送入梁內並提供部分垂直支撐，箱梁仍需足夠梁深承擔大部分彎矩。","textEn":"The main bridge is a five-tower, six-span prestressed concrete box-girder extradosed bridge with spans of 125 + 4×200 + 125 m and a length of 1,050 m. An extradosed bridge sits between a girder bridge and a cable-stayed bridge: towers are short and stays anchor into the girder at a shallow angle, acting like external prestress that pushes compression into the girder and adds partial vertical support, while the girder still needs enough depth to carry most of the bending.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：脊背橋只是橋塔比較矮的斜張橋，設計方法完全一樣。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: An extradosed bridge is just a cable-stayed bridge with short towers and is designed the same way. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「五塔六跨脊背橋的受力分工」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Load sharing in the five-tower extradosed bridge\" is correct?","options":["脊背橋只是橋塔比較矮的斜張橋，設計方法完全一樣。","只要基樁打到設計高程，就代表已經進入足夠的岩盤。","主橋為五塔六跨預力混凝土箱梁脊背橋，跨徑配置為 125 + 4×200 + 125 公尺，主橋長 1,050 公尺。"],"optionsEn":["An extradosed bridge is just a cable-stayed bridge with short towers and is designed the same way.","Reaching the design toe level means the pile is socketed into enough rock.","The main bridge is a five-tower, six-span prestressed concrete box-girder extradosed bridge with spans of 125 + 4×200 + 125 m and a length of 1,050 m."],"answer":2,"explanation":"主橋為五塔六跨預力混凝土箱梁脊背橋，跨徑配置為 125 + 4×200 + 125 公尺，主橋長 1,050 公尺。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The main bridge is a five-tower, six-span prestressed concrete box-girder extradosed bridge with spans of 125 + 4×200 + 125 m and a length of 1,050 m. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b002-v13-06","title":"五塔六跨脊背橋的受力分工：定量估算","titleEn":"Load sharing in the five-tower extradosed bridge: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「脊背索與低矮橋塔」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Extradosed stays and low towers” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：索力 T = 5,000 kN、索角 20° 時，垂直分量 V = T·sin20° ≈ 1,710 kN，水平壓力 H = T·cos20° ≈ 4,698 kN；斜張橋常見的 35° 則 V ≈ 2,868 kN、H ≈ 4,096 kN。以 f_pu = 1,860 MPa 計，0.6 f_pu = 1,116 MPa，0.45 f_pu = 837 MPa。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For a stay force T = 5,000 kN at 20°, the vertical component is V = T·sin20° ≈ 1,710 kN and the horizontal compression H = T·cos20° ≈ 4,698 kN; at a typical cable-stayed angle of 35°, V ≈ 2,868 kN and H ≈ 4,096 kN. With f_pu = 1,860 MPa, 0.6 f_pu = 1,116 MPa and 0.45 f_pu = 837 MPa. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以全橋有限元素模型比較有無脊背索時的箱梁彎矩包絡與撓度，確認索與梁各自承擔的比例；設計審查時逐根檢查活載應力幅，據以決定該索採用脊背索或斜張索的容許應力與疲勞試驗要求。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare girder moment envelopes and deflections with and without the stays in a whole-bridge finite-element model to confirm the share carried by stays and girder; in design review check the live-load stress range of every stay to decide whether extradosed or cable-stayed allowable stresses and fatigue-test requirements apply.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"索力 T = 5,000 kN、索角 20° 時，垂直分量 V = T·sin20° ≈ 1,710 kN，水平壓力 H = T·cos20° ≈ 4,698 kN；斜張橋常見的 35° 則 V ≈ 2,868 kN、H ≈ 4,096 kN。以 f_pu = 1,860 MPa 計，0.6 f_pu = 1,116 MPa，0.45 f_pu = 837 MPa。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"For a stay force T = 5,000 kN at 20°, the vertical component is V = T·sin20° ≈ 1,710 kN and the horizontal compression H = T·cos20° ≈ 4,698 kN; at a typical cable-stayed angle of 35°, V ≈ 2,868 kN and H ≈ 4,096 kN. With f_pu = 1,860 MPa, 0.6 f_pu = 1,116 MPa and 0.45 f_pu = 837 MPa. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「五塔六跨脊背橋的受力分工」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Load sharing in the five-tower extradosed bridge\", which statement holds?","options":["索力 T = 5,000 kN、索角 20° 時，垂直分量 V = T·sin20° ≈ 1,710 kN，水平壓力 H = T·cos20° ≈ 4,698 kN。","預鑄節塊在工廠做得很精準，現場就不需要幾何控制。","只要量到索的頻率，就能用同一個公式精確換算任何長度的索力。"],"optionsEn":["For a stay force T = 5,000 kN at 20°, the vertical component is V = T·sin20° ≈ 1,710 kN and the horizontal compression H = T·cos20° ≈ 4,698 kN.","Factory-precast segments are so precise that no geometry control is needed on site.","Once a stay's frequency is measured, one formula gives an exact force for any stay length."],"answer":0,"explanation":"索力 T = 5,000 kN、索角 20° 時，垂直分量 V = T·sin20° ≈ 1,710 kN，水平壓力 H = T·cos20° ≈ 4,698 kN；斜張橋常見的 35° 則 V ≈ 2,868 kN、H ≈ 4,096 kN。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For a stay force T = 5,000 kN at 20°, the vertical component is V = T·sin20° ≈ 1,710 kN and the horizontal compression H = T·cos20° ≈ 4,698 kN; at a typical cable-stayed angle of 35°, V ≈ 2,868 kN and H ≈ 4,096 kN. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b002-v13-07","title":"五塔六跨脊背橋的受力分工：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Load sharing in the five-tower extradosed bridge: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「脊背索與低矮橋塔」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Extradosed stays and low towers” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以全橋有限元素模型比較有無脊背索時的箱梁彎矩包絡與撓度，確認索與梁各自承擔的比例；設計審查時逐根檢查活載應力幅，據以決定該索採用脊背索或斜張索的容許應力與疲勞試驗要求。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare girder moment envelopes and deflections with and without the stays in a whole-bridge finite-element model to confirm the share carried by stays and girder; in design review check the live-load stress range of every stay to decide whether extradosed or cable-stayed allowable stresses and fatigue-test requirements apply. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：設計報告應列出每根索的活載應力幅並據以分類，寫明採用的容許應力比例與準則來源；多塔橋另列不對稱活載工況的塔頂位移與梁體應力檢核，並把結果交給施工監控作為比對基準。","observationEn":"Site practice: The design report should tabulate the live-load stress range of each stay and classify it, stating the allowable stress ratio and its source guideline; multi-tower bridges also need a separate check of tower-top drift and girder stress under unbalanced live load, handed to construction monitoring as a reference.","failure":"注意干擾：若把脊背索當成斜張索、以高應力幅假設設計，可能過度保守；反之若實際應力幅偏大卻採用較高容許應力，錨頭與塔頂鞍座可能提早疲勞。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Treating extradosed stays as cable-stays with a high assumed stress range can be over-conservative; conversely, using the higher allowable stress where the real range is large can fatigue anchorages and tower saddles early. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以全橋有限元素模型比較有無脊背索時的箱梁彎矩包絡與撓度，確認索與梁各自承擔的比例；設計審查時逐根檢查活載應力幅，據以決定該索採用脊背索或斜張索的容許應力與疲勞試驗要求。","textEn":"Compare girder moment envelopes and deflections with and without the stays in a whole-bridge finite-element model to confirm the share carried by stays and girder; in design review check the live-load stress range of every stay to decide whether extradosed or cable-stayed allowable stresses and fatigue-test requirements apply.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"設計報告應列出每根索的活載應力幅並據以分類，寫明採用的容許應力比例與準則來源；多塔橋另列不對稱活載工況的塔頂位移與梁體應力檢核，並把結果交給施工監控作為比對基準。","textEn":"The design report should tabulate the live-load stress range of each stay and classify it, stating the allowable stress ratio and its source guideline; multi-tower bridges also need a separate check of tower-top drift and girder stress under unbalanced live load, handed to construction monitoring as a reference.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「五塔六跨脊背橋的受力分工」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Load sharing in the five-tower extradosed bridge\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","以全橋有限元素模型比較有無脊背索時的箱梁彎矩包絡與撓度，確認索與梁各自承擔的比例。","混凝土強度越高，就一定不會發生鋼筋腐蝕。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Compare girder moment envelopes and deflections with and without the stays in a whole-bridge finite-element model to confirm the share carried by stays and girder.","Higher concrete strength alone guarantees the reinforcement will not corrode."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以全橋有限元素模型比較有無脊背索時的箱梁彎矩包絡與撓度，確認索與梁各自承擔的比例；設計審查時逐根檢查活載應力幅，據以決定該索採用脊背索或斜張索的容許應力與疲勞試驗要求。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare girder moment envelopes and deflections with and without the stays in a whole-bridge finite-element model to confirm the share carried by stays and girder; in design review check the live-load stress range of every stay to decide whether extradosed or cable-stayed allowable stresses and fatigue-test requirements apply. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b002-v13-08","title":"五塔六跨脊背橋的受力分工：失效診斷","titleEn":"Load sharing in the five-tower extradosed bridge: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「脊背索與低矮橋塔」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Extradosed stays and low towers” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若把脊背索當成斜張索、以高應力幅假設設計，可能過度保守；反之若實際應力幅偏大卻採用較高容許應力，錨頭與塔頂鞍座可能提早疲勞。多塔體系忽略不對稱活載時，中間塔頂偏移與箱梁開裂會超出預期。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Treating extradosed stays as cable-stays with a high assumed stress range can be over-conservative; conversely, using the higher allowable stress where the real range is large can fatigue anchorages and tower saddles early. Ignoring unbalanced live load in a multi-tower system lets inner-tower drift and girder cracking exceed expectations. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：多塔連續時，中間塔沒有錨碇跨平衡，不對稱活載下要靠箱梁與墩塔勁度控制變形。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: With several towers in a row, the inner towers have no anchor span to balance them, so girder and tower stiffness must control deformation under unbalanced live load.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「脊背橋只是橋塔比較矮的斜張橋，設計方法完全一樣。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An extradosed bridge is just a cable-stayed bridge with short towers and is designed the same way.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若把脊背索當成斜張索、以高應力幅假設設計，可能過度保守；反之若實際應力幅偏大卻採用較高容許應力，錨頭與塔頂鞍座可能提早疲勞。多塔體系忽略不對稱活載時，中間塔頂偏移與箱梁開裂會超出預期。","textEn":"Treating extradosed stays as cable-stays with a high assumed stress range can be over-conservative; conversely, using the higher allowable stress where the real range is large can fatigue anchorages and tower saddles early. Ignoring unbalanced live load in a multi-tower system lets inner-tower drift and girder cracking exceed expectations.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「五塔六跨脊背橋的受力分工」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Load sharing in the five-tower extradosed bridge\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","只要基樁打到設計高程，就代表已經進入足夠的岩盤。","若把脊背索當成斜張索、以高應力幅假設設計，可能過度保守；反之若實際應力幅偏大卻採用較高容許應力，錨頭與塔頂鞍座可能提早疲勞。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Reaching the design toe level means the pile is socketed into enough rock.","Treating extradosed stays as cable-stays with a high assumed stress range can be over-conservative."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若把脊背索當成斜張索、以高應力幅假設設計，可能過度保守；反之若實際應力幅偏大卻採用較高容許應力，錨頭與塔頂鞍座可能提早疲勞。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Treating extradosed stays as cable-stays with a high assumed stress range can be over-conservative; conversely, using the higher allowable stress where the real range is large can fatigue anchorages and tower saddles early. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b002-v13-s2","title":"材料、構件與接合細部","titleEn":"Materials, members and connection details","description":"本階段聚焦「花崗片麻岩中的全套管基樁」與「鋼箱圍堰與海中樁帽」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Cased bored piles in granitic gneiss\" and \"Steel box cofferdams and marine pile caps\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b002-v13-09","title":"花崗片麻岩中的全套管基樁：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Cased bored piles in granitic gneiss: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-08"],"objective":"說明「2.5 m 基樁嵌岩段」如何影響金門大橋（金門）的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “2.5 m pile rock socket” governs force, deformation or durability in “Kinmen Bridge”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"金門大橋約有 532 支基樁，主橋樁徑 2.5 公尺，邊橋 2.0 公尺，引橋 1.5 公尺，以全套管場鑄鋼筋混凝土樁施工。海床下是堅硬且傾斜、深度變化大的花崗片麻岩，大口徑基樁必須貫入岩盤，以嵌岩段側阻力與端承力承擔墩柱的垂直力與彎矩。岩面傾斜時，套管下端只有一側先碰到岩盤，容易造成鑽頭偏斜、樁底不完整或套管無法密封，因此每支樁的入岩深度要依實測岩面調整，而不是套用統一樁長。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「2.5 m 基樁嵌岩段」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Kinmen Bridge has about 532 piles: 2.5 m diameter under the main bridge, 2.0 m under the side bridges and 1.5 m under the approaches, all built as fully cased cast-in-place reinforced-concrete piles. Beneath the seabed lies hard granitic gneiss with a sloping, variable rock head, so large piles must penetrate the rock and carry pier axial force and moment through socket side resistance and end bearing. On a sloping rock face the casing touches rock on one side first, which can deflect the bit, leave an incomplete toe or prevent sealing, so each pile's socket length must follow the rock head actually found rather than a uniform pile length. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “2.5 m pile rock socket” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：嵌岩側阻 Q_s = π·D·L_s·f_s，取 D = 2.5 m、L_s = 6 m、f_s = 1.0 MPa：Q_s = π×2.5×6×1,000 ≈ 47,100 kN；端承 q_b = 5 MPa、A_b = π×2.5²/4 ≈ 4.91 m²，Q_b ≈ 24,500 kN。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Socket side resistance Q_s = π·D·L_s·f_s with D = 2.5 m, L_s = 6 m and f_s = 1.0 MPa gives Q_s = π×2.5×6×1,000 ≈ 47,100 kN; end bearing with q_b = 5 MPa on A_b = π×2.5²/4 ≈ 4.91 m² gives Q_b ≈ 24,500 kN.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要基樁打到設計高程，就代表已經進入足夠的岩盤。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Reaching the design toe level means the pile is socketed into enough rock.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「2.5 m 基樁嵌岩段」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “2.5 m pile rock socket”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-09-k1","title":"花崗片麻岩中的全套管基樁","titleEn":"Cased bored piles in granitic gneiss","text":"金門大橋約有 532 支基樁，主橋樁徑 2.5 公尺，邊橋 2.0 公尺，引橋 1.5 公尺，以全套管場鑄鋼筋混凝土樁施工。海床下是堅硬且傾斜、深度變化大的花崗片麻岩，大口徑基樁必須貫入岩盤，以嵌岩段側阻力與端承力承擔墩柱的垂直力與彎矩。","textEn":"Kinmen Bridge has about 532 piles: 2.5 m diameter under the main bridge, 2.0 m under the side bridges and 1.5 m under the approaches, all built as fully cased cast-in-place reinforced-concrete piles. Beneath the seabed lies hard granitic gneiss with a sloping, variable rock head, so large piles must penetrate the rock and carry pier axial force and moment through socket side resistance and end bearing.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要基樁打到設計高程，就代表已經進入足夠的岩盤。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Reaching the design toe level means the pile is socketed into enough rock. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「花崗片麻岩中的全套管基樁」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Cased bored piles in granitic gneiss\" is correct?","options":["金門大橋約有 532 支基樁，主橋樁徑 2.5 公尺，邊橋 2.0 公尺，引橋 1.5 公尺，以全套管場鑄鋼筋混凝土樁施工。","只要基樁打到設計高程，就代表已經進入足夠的岩盤。","鋼箱圍堰只是擋水的模板，抽水時不會產生很大的力。"],"optionsEn":["Kinmen Bridge has about 532 piles: 2.5 m diameter under the main bridge, 2.0 m under the side bridges and 1.5 m under the approaches, all built as fully cased cast-in-place reinforced-concrete piles.","Reaching the design toe level means the pile is socketed into enough rock.","A steel box cofferdam is only a formwork that keeps water out, so dewatering creates no large forces."],"answer":0,"explanation":"金門大橋約有 532 支基樁，主橋樁徑 2.5 公尺，邊橋 2.0 公尺，引橋 1.5 公尺，以全套管場鑄鋼筋混凝土樁施工。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Kinmen Bridge has about 532 piles: 2.5 m diameter under the main bridge, 2.0 m under the side bridges and 1.5 m under the approaches, all built as fully cased cast-in-place reinforced-concrete piles. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b002-v13-10","title":"花崗片麻岩中的全套管基樁：定量估算","titleEn":"Cased bored piles in granitic gneiss: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「2.5 m 基樁嵌岩段」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “2.5 m pile rock socket” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：嵌岩側阻 Q_s = π·D·L_s·f_s，取 D = 2.5 m、L_s = 6 m、f_s = 1.0 MPa：Q_s = π×2.5×6×1,000 ≈ 47,100 kN；端承 q_b = 5 MPa、A_b = π×2.5²/4 ≈ 4.91 m²，Q_b ≈ 24,500 kN。合計約 71,700 kN，安全係數 2.5 時容許約 28,700 kN。f_s、q_b、L_s 為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Socket side resistance Q_s = π·D·L_s·f_s with D = 2.5 m, L_s = 6 m and f_s = 1.0 MPa gives Q_s = π×2.5×6×1,000 ≈ 47,100 kN; end bearing with q_b = 5 MPa on A_b = π×2.5²/4 ≈ 4.91 m² gives Q_b ≈ 24,500 kN. The total is about 71,700 kN, or about 28,700 kN allowable with a factor of safety of 2.5. f_s, q_b and L_s are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：鑽掘時逐樁記錄入岩深度、岩屑性質與鑽進速率，並與地質鑽探柱狀圖比對；完成後以超音波井測檢查樁身完整性，抽樣鑽心確認樁底與岩盤接觸，代表性墩位以動態或雙向荷重試驗驗證承載力。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: During boring, log socket depth, cuttings and penetration rate for every pile and compare with borehole logs; afterwards check integrity by cross-hole sonic logging, core selected piles to confirm toe contact with rock, and verify capacity at representative piers by dynamic or bidirectional load tests.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"嵌岩側阻 Q_s = π·D·L_s·f_s，取 D = 2.5 m、L_s = 6 m、f_s = 1.0 MPa：Q_s = π×2.5×6×1,000 ≈ 47,100 kN；端承 q_b = 5 MPa、A_b = π×2.5²/4 ≈ 4.91 m²，Q_b ≈ 24,500 kN。合計約 71,700 kN，安全係數 2.5 時容許約 28,700 kN。f_s、q_b、L_s 為教學假設。","textEn":"Socket side resistance Q_s = π·D·L_s·f_s with D = 2.5 m, L_s = 6 m and f_s = 1.0 MPa gives Q_s = π×2.5×6×1,000 ≈ 47,100 kN; end bearing with q_b = 5 MPa on A_b = π×2.5²/4 ≈ 4.91 m² gives Q_b ≈ 24,500 kN. The total is about 71,700 kN, or about 28,700 kN allowable with a factor of safety of 2.5. f_s, q_b and L_s are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「花崗片麻岩中的全套管基樁」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Cased bored piles in granitic gneiss\", which statement holds?","options":["平衡懸臂工法兩側永遠等重，所以墩柱不會受到彎矩。","嵌岩側阻 Q_s = π·D·L_s·f_s，取 D = 2.5 m、L_s = 6 m、f_s = 1.0 MPa：Q_s = π×2.5×6×1,000 ≈ 47,100 kN。","載重試驗只要撓度小於計算值，就不必再檢查其他量測結果。"],"optionsEn":["In balanced cantilever erection both sides are always equal, so the pier never sees bending.","Socket side resistance Q_s = π·D·L_s·f_s with D = 2.5 m, L_s = 6 m and f_s = 1.0 MPa gives Q_s = π×2.5×6×1,000 ≈ 47,100 kN.","If load-test deflections are below the calculated values, no other measurement needs checking."],"answer":1,"explanation":"嵌岩側阻 Q_s = π·D·L_s·f_s，取 D = 2.5 m、L_s = 6 m、f_s = 1.0 MPa：Q_s = π×2.5×6×1,000 ≈ 47,100 kN；端承 q_b = 5 MPa、A_b = π×2.5²/4 ≈ 4.91 m²，Q_b ≈ 24,500 kN。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Socket side resistance Q_s = π·D·L_s·f_s with D = 2.5 m, L_s = 6 m and f_s = 1.0 MPa gives Q_s = π×2.5×6×1,000 ≈ 47,100 kN; end bearing with q_b = 5 MPa on A_b = π×2.5²/4 ≈ 4.91 m² gives Q_b ≈ 24,500 kN. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b002-v13-11","title":"花崗片麻岩中的全套管基樁：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Cased bored piles in granitic gneiss: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「2.5 m 基樁嵌岩段」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “2.5 m pile rock socket” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"鑽掘時逐樁記錄入岩深度、岩屑性質與鑽進速率，並與地質鑽探柱狀圖比對；完成後以超音波井測檢查樁身完整性，抽樣鑽心確認樁底與岩盤接觸，代表性墩位以動態或雙向荷重試驗驗證承載力。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"During boring, log socket depth, cuttings and penetration rate for every pile and compare with borehole logs; afterwards check integrity by cross-hole sonic logging, core selected piles to confirm toe contact with rock, and verify capacity at representative piers by dynamic or bidirectional load tests. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：規範應把入岩深度而非樁底高程列為停止條件，由地質工程師在現場確認岩性與岩面後簽認；清孔與沉泥厚度檢查列為澆置混凝土前的停留點，未合格不得澆置。","observationEn":"Site practice: The specification should make socket length into rock, not toe elevation, the termination criterion, signed off on site by a geotechnical engineer who has confirmed the rock type and rock head; base cleaning and sediment-thickness checks are a hold point before concreting.","failure":"注意干擾：樁底殘留沉泥或岩屑時，端承力大幅下降，基樁受載後產生額外沉陷；岩面傾斜使樁趾一側懸空、嵌岩有效長度不足，墩柱出現不均勻沉陷與樁帽開裂。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Sediment or cuttings left at the toe sharply reduce end bearing and cause extra settlement under load; a sloping rock head that leaves one side of the toe unsupported shortens the effective socket, producing differential pier settlement and pile-cap cracking. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"鑽掘時逐樁記錄入岩深度、岩屑性質與鑽進速率，並與地質鑽探柱狀圖比對；完成後以超音波井測檢查樁身完整性，抽樣鑽心確認樁底與岩盤接觸，代表性墩位以動態或雙向荷重試驗驗證承載力。","textEn":"During boring, log socket depth, cuttings and penetration rate for every pile and compare with borehole logs; afterwards check integrity by cross-hole sonic logging, core selected piles to confirm toe contact with rock, and verify capacity at representative piers by dynamic or bidirectional load tests.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"規範應把入岩深度而非樁底高程列為停止條件，由地質工程師在現場確認岩性與岩面後簽認；清孔與沉泥厚度檢查列為澆置混凝土前的停留點，未合格不得澆置。","textEn":"The specification should make socket length into rock, not toe elevation, the termination criterion, signed off on site by a geotechnical engineer who has confirmed the rock type and rock head; base cleaning and sediment-thickness checks are a hold point before concreting.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「花崗片麻岩中的全套管基樁」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Cased bored piles in granitic gneiss\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","伸縮縫只是行車舒適性的配件，損壞時不影響結構。","鑽掘時逐樁記錄入岩深度、岩屑性質與鑽進速率，並與地質鑽探柱狀圖比對。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","Expansion joints only affect ride comfort, so their damage does not matter structurally.","During boring, log socket depth, cuttings and penetration rate for every pile and compare with borehole logs."],"answer":2,"explanation":"鑽掘時逐樁記錄入岩深度、岩屑性質與鑽進速率，並與地質鑽探柱狀圖比對；完成後以超音波井測檢查樁身完整性，抽樣鑽心確認樁底與岩盤接觸，代表性墩位以動態或雙向荷重試驗驗證承載力。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"During boring, log socket depth, cuttings and penetration rate for every pile and compare with borehole logs; afterwards check integrity by cross-hole sonic logging, core selected piles to confirm toe contact with rock, and verify capacity at representative piers by dynamic or bidirectional load tests. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b002-v13-12","title":"花崗片麻岩中的全套管基樁：失效診斷","titleEn":"Cased bored piles in granitic gneiss: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「2.5 m 基樁嵌岩段」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “2.5 m pile rock socket” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"樁底殘留沉泥或岩屑時，端承力大幅下降，基樁受載後產生額外沉陷；岩面傾斜使樁趾一側懸空、嵌岩有效長度不足，墩柱出現不均勻沉陷與樁帽開裂。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Sediment or cuttings left at the toe sharply reduce end bearing and cause extra settlement under load; a sloping rock head that leaves one side of the toe unsupported shortens the effective socket, producing differential pier settlement and pile-cap cracking. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：岩面傾斜時，套管下端只有一側先碰到岩盤，容易造成鑽頭偏斜、樁底不完整或套管無法密封，因此每支樁的入岩深度要依實測岩面調整，而不是套用統一樁長。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: On a sloping rock face the casing touches rock on one side first, which can deflect the bit, leave an incomplete toe or prevent sealing, so each pile's socket length must follow the rock head actually found rather than a uniform pile length.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要基樁打到設計高程，就代表已經進入足夠的岩盤。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Reaching the design toe level means the pile is socketed into enough rock.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"樁底殘留沉泥或岩屑時，端承力大幅下降，基樁受載後產生額外沉陷；岩面傾斜使樁趾一側懸空、嵌岩有效長度不足，墩柱出現不均勻沉陷與樁帽開裂。","textEn":"Sediment or cuttings left at the toe sharply reduce end bearing and cause extra settlement under load; a sloping rock head that leaves one side of the toe unsupported shortens the effective socket, producing differential pier settlement and pile-cap cracking.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「花崗片麻岩中的全套管基樁」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Cased bored piles in granitic gneiss\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["樁底殘留沉泥或岩屑時，端承力大幅下降，基樁受載後產生額外沉陷；岩面傾斜使樁趾一側懸空、嵌岩有效長度不足，墩柱出現不均勻沉陷與樁帽開裂。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","鋼箱圍堰只是擋水的模板，抽水時不會產生很大的力。"],"optionsEn":["Sediment or cuttings left at the toe sharply reduce end bearing and cause extra settlement under load.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A steel box cofferdam is only a formwork that keeps water out, so dewatering creates no large forces."],"answer":0,"explanation":"樁底殘留沉泥或岩屑時，端承力大幅下降，基樁受載後產生額外沉陷；岩面傾斜使樁趾一側懸空、嵌岩有效長度不足，墩柱出現不均勻沉陷與樁帽開裂。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Sediment or cuttings left at the toe sharply reduce end bearing and cause extra settlement under load; a sloping rock head that leaves one side of the toe unsupported shortens the effective socket, producing differential pier settlement and pile-cap cracking. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b002-v13-13","title":"鋼箱圍堰與海中樁帽：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Steel box cofferdams and marine pile caps: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-12"],"objective":"說明「鋼箱圍堰封底混凝土」如何影響金門大橋（金門）的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Steel box cofferdam seal” governs force, deformation or durability in “Kinmen Bridge”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"深槽區主橋與邊橋的樁帽以鋼箱圍堰施工，公開報導稱是國內首次採用。鋼箱在海上組裝後下放包住樁頭，先在水下澆置封底混凝土，再抽乾箱內海水，讓樁帽在乾燥環境中綁筋與澆置。抽水後海水壓力從下方頂住封底板，所以封底混凝土必須靠自重、與樁身的握裹以及鋼箱摩擦共同抵抗上浮；報導提到下放時須抵抗約 4,000 公噸的海水浮力。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「鋼箱圍堰封底混凝土」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The pile caps of the main and side bridges in the deep trough were built inside steel box cofferdams, reported as a first in Taiwan. The box is assembled at sea and lowered around the pile heads, a seal slab is concreted underwater, and the box is then pumped dry so the cap can be reinforced and cast in the dry. After dewatering, sea pressure pushes up on the seal slab, so its self-weight, its bond to the piles and friction on the box walls must together resist uplift; reports mention about 4,000 t of buoyancy to overcome during lowering. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Steel box cofferdam seal” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：上浮壓力 p = ρ·g·h = 1.025×9.81×6.5 ≈ 65.4 kPa；底面積 A = 30×20 = 600 m² 時總上浮力約 39,200 kN，約 4,000 公噸。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Uplift pressure p = ρ·g·h = 1.025×9.81×6.5 ≈ 65.4 kPa; on A = 30×20 = 600 m² the total uplift is about 39,200 kN, or about 4,000 t.","failure":"常見誤解：「鋼箱圍堰只是擋水的模板，抽水時不會產生很大的力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A steel box cofferdam is only a formwork that keeps water out, so dewatering creates no large forces.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「鋼箱圍堰封底混凝土」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Steel box cofferdam seal”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-13-k1","title":"鋼箱圍堰與海中樁帽","titleEn":"Steel box cofferdams and marine pile caps","text":"深槽區主橋與邊橋的樁帽以鋼箱圍堰施工，公開報導稱是國內首次採用。鋼箱在海上組裝後下放包住樁頭，先在水下澆置封底混凝土，再抽乾箱內海水，讓樁帽在乾燥環境中綁筋與澆置。","textEn":"The pile caps of the main and side bridges in the deep trough were built inside steel box cofferdams, reported as a first in Taiwan. The box is assembled at sea and lowered around the pile heads, a seal slab is concreted underwater, and the box is then pumped dry so the cap can be reinforced and cast in the dry.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：鋼箱圍堰只是擋水的模板，抽水時不會產生很大的力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A steel box cofferdam is only a formwork that keeps water out, so dewatering creates no large forces. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「鋼箱圍堰與海中樁帽」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Steel box cofferdams and marine pile caps\" is correct?","options":["鋼箱圍堰只是擋水的模板，抽水時不會產生很大的力。","深槽區主橋與邊橋的樁帽以鋼箱圍堰施工，公開報導稱是國內首次採用。","預鑄節塊在工廠做得很精準，現場就不需要幾何控制。"],"optionsEn":["A steel box cofferdam is only a formwork that keeps water out, so dewatering creates no large forces.","The pile caps of the main and side bridges in the deep trough were built inside steel box cofferdams, reported as a first in Taiwan.","Factory-precast segments are so precise that no geometry control is needed on site."],"answer":1,"explanation":"深槽區主橋與邊橋的樁帽以鋼箱圍堰施工，公開報導稱是國內首次採用。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The pile caps of the main and side bridges in the deep trough were built inside steel box cofferdams, reported as a first in Taiwan. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b002-v13-14","title":"鋼箱圍堰與海中樁帽：定量估算","titleEn":"Steel box cofferdams and marine pile caps: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「鋼箱圍堰封底混凝土」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Steel box cofferdam seal” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：上浮壓力 p = ρ·g·h = 1.025×9.81×6.5 ≈ 65.4 kPa；底面積 A = 30×20 = 600 m² 時總上浮力約 39,200 kN，約 4,000 公噸。只靠自重需封底厚 65.4/24 ≈ 2.7 m；若封底只取 1.5 m，其餘 (65.4 − 36)×600 ≈ 17,600 kN 須由樁身握裹承擔。尺寸與水頭為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Uplift pressure p = ρ·g·h = 1.025×9.81×6.5 ≈ 65.4 kPa; on A = 30×20 = 600 m² the total uplift is about 39,200 kN, or about 4,000 t. Self-weight alone would need a seal 65.4/24 ≈ 2.7 m thick; with a 1.5 m seal, the remaining (65.4 − 36)×600 ≈ 17,600 kN must be carried by pile bond. Dimensions and head are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：封底混凝土以導管法連續澆置，持續量測澆置面高程與導管埋深；抽水分階段進行，每階段量測箱內水位、封底板變形、鋼箱應變與滲漏量，與設計上浮檢核比對，確認無異常後才進入下一階段。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Place the seal by tremie continuously while measuring concrete level and tremie embedment; dewater in stages and at each stage record inner water level, seal-slab deformation, box strains and leakage, comparing them with the uplift check before proceeding.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"上浮壓力 p = ρ·g·h = 1.025×9.81×6.5 ≈ 65.4 kPa；底面積 A = 30×20 = 600 m² 時總上浮力約 39,200 kN，約 4,000 公噸。只靠自重需封底厚 65.4/24 ≈ 2.7 m；若封底只取 1.5 m，其餘 (65.4 − 36)×600 ≈ 17,600 kN 須由樁身握裹承擔。尺寸與水頭為教學假設。","textEn":"Uplift pressure p = ρ·g·h = 1.025×9.81×6.5 ≈ 65.4 kPa; on A = 30×20 = 600 m² the total uplift is about 39,200 kN, or about 4,000 t. Self-weight alone would need a seal 65.4/24 ≈ 2.7 m thick; with a 1.5 m seal, the remaining (65.4 − 36)×600 ≈ 17,600 kN must be carried by pile bond. Dimensions and head are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「鋼箱圍堰與海中樁帽」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Steel box cofferdams and marine pile caps\", which statement holds?","options":["只要量到索的頻率，就能用同一個公式精確換算任何長度的索力。","混凝土強度越高，就一定不會發生鋼筋腐蝕。","上浮壓力 p = ρ·g·h = 1.025×9.81×6.5 ≈ 65.4 kPa。"],"optionsEn":["Once a stay's frequency is measured, one formula gives an exact force for any stay length.","Higher concrete strength alone guarantees the reinforcement will not corrode.","Uplift pressure p = ρ·g·h = 1.025×9.81×6.5 ≈ 65.4 kPa; on A = 30×20 = 600 m² the total uplift is about 39,200 kN, or about 4,000 t."],"answer":2,"explanation":"上浮壓力 p = ρ·g·h = 1.025×9.81×6.5 ≈ 65.4 kPa；底面積 A = 30×20 = 600 m² 時總上浮力約 39,200 kN，約 4,000 公噸。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Uplift pressure p = ρ·g·h = 1.025×9.81×6.5 ≈ 65.4 kPa; on A = 30×20 = 600 m² the total uplift is about 39,200 kN, or about 4,000 t. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b002-v13-15","title":"鋼箱圍堰與海中樁帽：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Steel box cofferdams and marine pile caps: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「鋼箱圍堰封底混凝土」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Steel box cofferdam seal” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"封底混凝土以導管法連續澆置，持續量測澆置面高程與導管埋深；抽水分階段進行，每階段量測箱內水位、封底板變形、鋼箱應變與滲漏量，與設計上浮檢核比對，確認無異常後才進入下一階段。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Place the seal by tremie continuously while measuring concrete level and tremie embedment; dewater in stages and at each stage record inner water level, seal-slab deformation, box strains and leakage, comparing them with the uplift check before proceeding. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：抽水作業列為停留點：封底強度達標、潛水員檢查封底面與樁身介面、量測儀器就位後，由工程師核准分段抽水；每階段設停止條件，例如滲水量或變形超過預警值即停止並回灌。","observationEn":"Site practice: Make dewatering a hold point: once the seal reaches strength, divers have checked the seal and pile interfaces and instruments are installed, the engineer authorises staged pumping; each stage has stop criteria, such as leakage or deformation beyond alert values triggering a halt and re-flooding.","failure":"注意干擾：封底混凝土夾泥或厚度不足時，抽水後封底板開裂、湧水甚至整體上浮；鋼箱下放偏位會使樁頭與箱壁碰撞，樁帽保護層不足，日後成為海水滲入的弱點。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A seal containing mud lenses or built too thin can crack, let water burst in or even float the whole box after dewatering; a box lowered off position can clash with pile heads and leave thin cover on the cap, a future path for seawater. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"封底混凝土以導管法連續澆置，持續量測澆置面高程與導管埋深；抽水分階段進行，每階段量測箱內水位、封底板變形、鋼箱應變與滲漏量，與設計上浮檢核比對，確認無異常後才進入下一階段。","textEn":"Place the seal by tremie continuously while measuring concrete level and tremie embedment; dewater in stages and at each stage record inner water level, seal-slab deformation, box strains and leakage, comparing them with the uplift check before proceeding.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"抽水作業列為停留點：封底強度達標、潛水員檢查封底面與樁身介面、量測儀器就位後，由工程師核准分段抽水；每階段設停止條件，例如滲水量或變形超過預警值即停止並回灌。","textEn":"Make dewatering a hold point: once the seal reaches strength, divers have checked the seal and pile interfaces and instruments are installed, the engineer authorises staged pumping; each stage has stop criteria, such as leakage or deformation beyond alert values triggering a halt and re-flooding.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「鋼箱圍堰與海中樁帽」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Steel box cofferdams and marine pile caps\"?","options":["封底混凝土以導管法連續澆置，持續量測澆置面高程與導管埋深。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","海上橋梁的基礎設計只要考慮完工後的營運荷載就足夠。"],"optionsEn":["Place the seal by tremie continuously while measuring concrete level and tremie embedment.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Designing a marine bridge foundation only needs the in-service loads of the finished bridge."],"answer":0,"explanation":"封底混凝土以導管法連續澆置，持續量測澆置面高程與導管埋深；抽水分階段進行，每階段量測箱內水位、封底板變形、鋼箱應變與滲漏量，與設計上浮檢核比對，確認無異常後才進入下一階段。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Place the seal by tremie continuously while measuring concrete level and tremie embedment; dewater in stages and at each stage record inner water level, seal-slab deformation, box strains and leakage, comparing them with the uplift check before proceeding. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b002-v13-16","title":"鋼箱圍堰與海中樁帽：失效診斷","titleEn":"Steel box cofferdams and marine pile caps: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「鋼箱圍堰封底混凝土」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Steel box cofferdam seal” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"封底混凝土夾泥或厚度不足時，抽水後封底板開裂、湧水甚至整體上浮；鋼箱下放偏位會使樁頭與箱壁碰撞，樁帽保護層不足，日後成為海水滲入的弱點。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A seal containing mud lenses or built too thin can crack, let water burst in or even float the whole box after dewatering; a box lowered off position can clash with pile heads and leave thin cover on the cap, a future path for seawater. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：抽水後海水壓力從下方頂住封底板，所以封底混凝土必須靠自重、與樁身的握裹以及鋼箱摩擦共同抵抗上浮；報導提到下放時須抵抗約 4,000 公噸的海水浮力。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: After dewatering, sea pressure pushes up on the seal slab, so its self-weight, its bond to the piles and friction on the box walls must together resist uplift; reports mention about 4,000 t of buoyancy to overcome during lowering.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「鋼箱圍堰只是擋水的模板，抽水時不會產生很大的力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A steel box cofferdam is only a formwork that keeps water out, so dewatering creates no large forces.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"封底混凝土夾泥或厚度不足時，抽水後封底板開裂、湧水甚至整體上浮；鋼箱下放偏位會使樁頭與箱壁碰撞，樁帽保護層不足，日後成為海水滲入的弱點。","textEn":"A seal containing mud lenses or built too thin can crack, let water burst in or even float the whole box after dewatering; a box lowered off position can clash with pile heads and leave thin cover on the cap, a future path for seawater.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「鋼箱圍堰與海中樁帽」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Steel box cofferdams and marine pile caps\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","封底混凝土夾泥或厚度不足時，抽水後封底板開裂、湧水甚至整體上浮；鋼箱下放偏位會使樁頭與箱壁碰撞，樁帽保護層不足，日後成為海水滲入的弱點。","預鑄節塊在工廠做得很精準，現場就不需要幾何控制。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","A seal containing mud lenses or built too thin can crack, let water burst in or even float the whole box after dewatering.","Factory-precast segments are so precise that no geometry control is needed on site."],"answer":1,"explanation":"封底混凝土夾泥或厚度不足時，抽水後封底板開裂、湧水甚至整體上浮；鋼箱下放偏位會使樁頭與箱壁碰撞，樁帽保護層不足，日後成為海水滲入的弱點。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A seal containing mud lenses or built too thin can crack, let water burst in or even float the whole box after dewatering; a box lowered off position can clash with pile heads and leave thin cover on the cap, a future path for seawater. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b002-v13-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「興達港預鑄節塊與海上運輸」與「平衡懸臂吊裝與全橋合龍」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Segments precast at Hsing-ta Harbour and shipped\" and \"Balanced-cantilever erection and closure\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b002-v13-17","title":"興達港預鑄節塊與海上運輸：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Segments precast at Hsing-ta Harbour and shipped: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-16"],"objective":"說明「短線匹配澆鑄台座」如何影響金門大橋（金門）的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Short-line match-casting cell” governs force, deformation or durability in “Kinmen Bridge”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"公開資料指出，上部結構使用 376 塊預鑄節塊，於高雄興達港生產後以船舶運到金門吊裝。預鑄節塊通常以短線匹配澆鑄：新節塊緊貼前一塊已完成的節塊澆置，接縫面完全吻合，到現場再依相同順序拼裝。這讓混凝土品質與養護在工廠條件下控制，但每一塊的幾何誤差會沿懸臂累積，所以澆鑄台座的測量與修正是全橋線形的源頭。長距離海運還增加堆置、繫固與天候窗口的不確定性，生產節奏必須與吊裝節奏協調。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「短線匹配澆鑄台座」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Public reports state that the superstructure used 376 precast segments, produced at Hsing-ta Harbour in Kaohsiung and shipped to Kinmen for erection. Such segments are usually short-line match-cast: each new segment is cast against the previous one so the joint faces fit exactly, and they are erected in the same order on site. Concrete quality and curing are controlled under factory conditions, but each segment's geometric error accumulates along the cantilever, so survey and correction in the casting cell are the source of the whole bridge's alignment. Long sea transport adds uncertainty in storage, sea-fastening and weather windows, so production must be paced with erection. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Short-line match-casting cell” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：若第 2 號節塊接縫有 0.5 mrad 的角度誤差，其後懸臂長度 95 m，懸臂端偏差 Δ = θ·L = 0.0005×95 ≈ 0.0475 m = 47.5 mm；同樣誤差若出現在倒數第二塊、其後只剩 5 m，只造成約 2.5 mm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: If the joint of segment 2 has a 0.5 mrad angular error and 95 m of cantilever follows it, the tip deviates by Δ = θ·L = 0.0005×95 ≈ 0.0475 m = 47.5 mm; the same error in the second-last segment, with only 5 m beyond, causes about 2.5 mm.","failure":"常見誤解：「預鑄節塊在工廠做得很精準，現場就不需要幾何控制。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Factory-precast segments are so precise that no geometry control is needed on site.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「短線匹配澆鑄台座」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Short-line match-casting cell”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-17-k1","title":"興達港預鑄節塊與海上運輸","titleEn":"Segments precast at Hsing-ta Harbour and shipped","text":"公開資料指出，上部結構使用 376 塊預鑄節塊，於高雄興達港生產後以船舶運到金門吊裝。預鑄節塊通常以短線匹配澆鑄：新節塊緊貼前一塊已完成的節塊澆置，接縫面完全吻合，到現場再依相同順序拼裝。","textEn":"Public reports state that the superstructure used 376 precast segments, produced at Hsing-ta Harbour in Kaohsiung and shipped to Kinmen for erection. Such segments are usually short-line match-cast: each new segment is cast against the previous one so the joint faces fit exactly, and they are erected in the same order on site.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：預鑄節塊在工廠做得很精準，現場就不需要幾何控制。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Factory-precast segments are so precise that no geometry control is needed on site. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「興達港預鑄節塊與海上運輸」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Segments precast at Hsing-ta Harbour and shipped\" is correct?","options":["預鑄節塊在工廠做得很精準，現場就不需要幾何控制。","平衡懸臂工法兩側永遠等重，所以墩柱不會受到彎矩。","公開資料指出，上部結構使用 376 塊預鑄節塊，於高雄興達港生產後以船舶運到金門吊裝。"],"optionsEn":["Factory-precast segments are so precise that no geometry control is needed on site.","In balanced cantilever erection both sides are always equal, so the pier never sees bending.","Public reports state that the superstructure used 376 precast segments, produced at Hsing-ta Harbour in Kaohsiung and shipped to Kinmen for erection."],"answer":2,"explanation":"公開資料指出，上部結構使用 376 塊預鑄節塊，於高雄興達港生產後以船舶運到金門吊裝。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Public reports state that the superstructure used 376 precast segments, produced at Hsing-ta Harbour in Kaohsiung and shipped to Kinmen for erection. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b002-v13-18","title":"興達港預鑄節塊與海上運輸：定量估算","titleEn":"Segments precast at Hsing-ta Harbour and shipped: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「短線匹配澆鑄台座」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Short-line match-casting cell” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：若第 2 號節塊接縫有 0.5 mrad 的角度誤差，其後懸臂長度 95 m，懸臂端偏差 Δ = θ·L = 0.0005×95 ≈ 0.0475 m = 47.5 mm；同樣誤差若出現在倒數第二塊、其後只剩 5 m，只造成約 2.5 mm。越靠近墩頂的誤差影響越大。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: If the joint of segment 2 has a 0.5 mrad angular error and 95 m of cantilever follows it, the tip deviates by Δ = θ·L = 0.0005×95 ≈ 0.0475 m = 47.5 mm; the same error in the second-last segment, with only 5 m beyond, causes about 2.5 mm. Errors near the pier matter most. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：每塊澆置後量測匹配節塊上的控制點高程與平面位置，以幾何控制程式比較實測與理論，於下一塊澆置時修正匹配節塊位置；出廠前檢查剪力鍵、預力孔道位置與強度紀錄，裝船時確認支墊與繫固符合計畫。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: After each cast, survey the control points on the match-cast segment in level and plan, compare with theory in the geometry-control software and correct the match segment's position for the next cast; before shipment check shear keys, duct positions and strength records, and confirm bearing pads and sea-fastening against the plan.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"若第 2 號節塊接縫有 0.5 mrad 的角度誤差，其後懸臂長度 95 m，懸臂端偏差 Δ = θ·L = 0.0005×95 ≈ 0.0475 m = 47.5 mm；同樣誤差若出現在倒數第二塊、其後只剩 5 m，只造成約 2.5 mm。越靠近墩頂的誤差影響越大。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"If the joint of segment 2 has a 0.5 mrad angular error and 95 m of cantilever follows it, the tip deviates by Δ = θ·L = 0.0005×95 ≈ 0.0475 m = 47.5 mm; the same error in the second-last segment, with only 5 m beyond, causes about 2.5 mm. Errors near the pier matter most. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「興達港預鑄節塊與海上運輸」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Segments precast at Hsing-ta Harbour and shipped\", which statement holds?","options":["若第 2 號節塊接縫有 0.5 mrad 的角度誤差，其後懸臂長度 95 m，懸臂端偏差 Δ = θ·L = 0.0005×95 ≈ 0.0475 m = 47.5 mm。","載重試驗只要撓度小於計算值，就不必再檢查其他量測結果。","伸縮縫只是行車舒適性的配件，損壞時不影響結構。"],"optionsEn":["If the joint of segment 2 has a 0.5 mrad angular error and 95 m of cantilever follows it, the tip deviates by Δ = θ·L = 0.0005×95 ≈ 0.0475 m = 47.5 mm.","If load-test deflections are below the calculated values, no other measurement needs checking.","Expansion joints only affect ride comfort, so their damage does not matter structurally."],"answer":0,"explanation":"若第 2 號節塊接縫有 0.5 mrad 的角度誤差，其後懸臂長度 95 m，懸臂端偏差 Δ = θ·L = 0.0005×95 ≈ 0.0475 m = 47.5 mm；同樣誤差若出現在倒數第二塊、其後只剩 5 m，只造成約 2.5 mm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"If the joint of segment 2 has a 0.5 mrad angular error and 95 m of cantilever follows it, the tip deviates by Δ = θ·L = 0.0005×95 ≈ 0.0475 m = 47.5 mm; the same error in the second-last segment, with only 5 m beyond, causes about 2.5 mm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b002-v13-19","title":"興達港預鑄節塊與海上運輸：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Segments precast at Hsing-ta Harbour and shipped: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「短線匹配澆鑄台座」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Short-line match-casting cell” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"每塊澆置後量測匹配節塊上的控制點高程與平面位置，以幾何控制程式比較實測與理論，於下一塊澆置時修正匹配節塊位置；出廠前檢查剪力鍵、預力孔道位置與強度紀錄，裝船時確認支墊與繫固符合計畫。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"After each cast, survey the control points on the match-cast segment in level and plan, compare with theory in the geometry-control software and correct the match segment's position for the next cast; before shipment check shear keys, duct positions and strength records, and confirm bearing pads and sea-fastening against the plan. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：幾何控制應由獨立的測量與分析小組負責，每塊節塊建立理論、實測與修正三欄紀錄；運輸與吊裝前定義吊點、支墊位置與繫固方式，並確認混凝土強度已達吊裝規定。","observationEn":"Site practice: Geometry control belongs to an independent survey and analysis team that keeps a theory, as-cast and correction record for every segment; lifting points, support positions and sea-fastening are defined before transport, and concrete strength must meet the lifting requirement.","failure":"注意干擾：若量測只記錄誤差而不在後續節塊修正，偏差累積到懸臂端，合龍時高程差過大，只能以強制頂撐或加厚合龍段處理並造成附加應力；運輸時繫固不良則可能使節塊邊角破損、剪力鍵受損而影響接縫傳力。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: If errors are merely recorded and not corrected in later segments, they accumulate to the tip and the closure shows a large level difference, forcing jacking or a thickened closure with added stresses; poor sea-fastening can chip edges and damage shear keys, impairing joint load transfer. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"每塊澆置後量測匹配節塊上的控制點高程與平面位置，以幾何控制程式比較實測與理論，於下一塊澆置時修正匹配節塊位置；出廠前檢查剪力鍵、預力孔道位置與強度紀錄，裝船時確認支墊與繫固符合計畫。","textEn":"After each cast, survey the control points on the match-cast segment in level and plan, compare with theory in the geometry-control software and correct the match segment's position for the next cast; before shipment check shear keys, duct positions and strength records, and confirm bearing pads and sea-fastening against the plan.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"幾何控制應由獨立的測量與分析小組負責，每塊節塊建立理論、實測與修正三欄紀錄；運輸與吊裝前定義吊點、支墊位置與繫固方式，並確認混凝土強度已達吊裝規定。","textEn":"Geometry control belongs to an independent survey and analysis team that keeps a theory, as-cast and correction record for every segment; lifting points, support positions and sea-fastening are defined before transport, and concrete strength must meet the lifting requirement.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「興達港預鑄節塊與海上運輸」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Segments precast at Hsing-ta Harbour and shipped\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","每塊澆置後量測匹配節塊上的控制點高程與平面位置，以幾何控制程式比較實測與理論，於下一塊澆置時修正匹配節塊位置。","脊背橋只是橋塔比較矮的斜張橋，設計方法完全一樣。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","After each cast, survey the control points on the match-cast segment in level and plan, compare with theory in the geometry-control software and correct the match segment's position for the next cast.","An extradosed bridge is just a cable-stayed bridge with short towers and is designed the same way."],"answer":1,"explanation":"每塊澆置後量測匹配節塊上的控制點高程與平面位置，以幾何控制程式比較實測與理論，於下一塊澆置時修正匹配節塊位置；出廠前檢查剪力鍵、預力孔道位置與強度紀錄，裝船時確認支墊與繫固符合計畫。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"After each cast, survey the control points on the match-cast segment in level and plan, compare with theory in the geometry-control software and correct the match segment's position for the next cast; before shipment check shear keys, duct positions and strength records, and confirm bearing pads and sea-fastening against the plan. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b002-v13-20","title":"興達港預鑄節塊與海上運輸：失效診斷","titleEn":"Segments precast at Hsing-ta Harbour and shipped: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「短線匹配澆鑄台座」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Short-line match-casting cell” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"若量測只記錄誤差而不在後續節塊修正，偏差累積到懸臂端，合龍時高程差過大，只能以強制頂撐或加厚合龍段處理並造成附加應力；運輸時繫固不良則可能使節塊邊角破損、剪力鍵受損而影響接縫傳力。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"If errors are merely recorded and not corrected in later segments, they accumulate to the tip and the closure shows a large level difference, forcing jacking or a thickened closure with added stresses; poor sea-fastening can chip edges and damage shear keys, impairing joint load transfer. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：長距離海運還增加堆置、繫固與天候窗口的不確定性，生產節奏必須與吊裝節奏協調。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Long sea transport adds uncertainty in storage, sea-fastening and weather windows, so production must be paced with erection.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「預鑄節塊在工廠做得很精準，現場就不需要幾何控制。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Factory-precast segments are so precise that no geometry control is needed on site.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若量測只記錄誤差而不在後續節塊修正，偏差累積到懸臂端，合龍時高程差過大，只能以強制頂撐或加厚合龍段處理並造成附加應力；運輸時繫固不良則可能使節塊邊角破損、剪力鍵受損而影響接縫傳力。","textEn":"If errors are merely recorded and not corrected in later segments, they accumulate to the tip and the closure shows a large level difference, forcing jacking or a thickened closure with added stresses; poor sea-fastening can chip edges and damage shear keys, impairing joint load transfer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「興達港預鑄節塊與海上運輸」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Segments precast at Hsing-ta Harbour and shipped\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","平衡懸臂工法兩側永遠等重，所以墩柱不會受到彎矩。","若量測只記錄誤差而不在後續節塊修正，偏差累積到懸臂端，合龍時高程差過大，只能以強制頂撐或加厚合龍段處理並造成附加應力。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","In balanced cantilever erection both sides are always equal, so the pier never sees bending.","If errors are merely recorded and not corrected in later segments, they accumulate to the tip and the closure shows a large level difference, forcing jacking or a thickened closure with added stresses."],"answer":2,"explanation":"若量測只記錄誤差而不在後續節塊修正，偏差累積到懸臂端，合龍時高程差過大，只能以強制頂撐或加厚合龍段處理並造成附加應力；運輸時繫固不良則可能使節塊邊角破損、剪力鍵受損而影響接縫傳力。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If errors are merely recorded and not corrected in later segments, they accumulate to the tip and the closure shows a large level difference, forcing jacking or a thickened closure with added stresses; poor sea-fastening can chip edges and damage shear keys, impairing joint load transfer. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b002-v13-21","title":"平衡懸臂吊裝與全橋合龍：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Balanced-cantilever erection and closure: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-20"],"objective":"說明「墩頂懸臂不平衡彎矩」如何影響金門大橋（金門）的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Unbalanced moment at pier head” governs force, deformation or durability in “Kinmen Bridge”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"主橋與邊橋採懸臂工法：節塊從墩頂向兩側對稱吊裝，以預力鋼腱把新節塊壓緊在已完成的懸臂上，直到相鄰懸臂在跨中接近，再澆置合龍段使結構連續。施工中墩柱與基礎要承擔兩側重量差、吊裝設備與風荷載，常以臨時錨定、臨時支撐或墩梁臨時固結來穩定。合龍後結構由懸臂體系轉為連續體系，預力、溫度與潛變效應重新分配。金門大橋在 2022 年 7 月 22 日完成全橋合龍。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「墩頂懸臂不平衡彎矩」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The main and side bridges were built by the cantilever method: segments are erected symmetrically outward from each pier head and stressed against the completed cantilever until neighbouring cantilevers meet near mid-span, where a closure pour makes the girder continuous. During erection the pier and foundation carry the weight imbalance, lifting equipment and wind, usually stabilised by temporary ties, props or a temporary pier–girder fixity. After closure the structure changes from cantilevers to a continuous system, redistributing prestress, temperature and creep effects. Kinmen Bridge achieved full closure on 22 July 2022. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Unbalanced moment at pier head” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：一側先吊一塊 1,500 kN 節塊、距墩中心 95 m 時，不平衡彎矩 M = W·a = 1,500×95 = 142,500 kN·m；若臨時錨定的力臂為 4 m，需拉力約 142,500/4 ≈ 35,600 kN。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Lifting one 1,500 kN segment on one side at 95 m from the pier centre gives an unbalanced moment M = W·a = 1,500×95 = 142,500 kN·m; with a 4 m lever arm, the temporary tie must carry about 142,500/4 ≈ 35,600 kN.","failure":"常見誤解：「平衡懸臂工法兩側永遠等重，所以墩柱不會受到彎矩。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"In balanced cantilever erection both sides are always equal, so the pier never sees bending.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「墩頂懸臂不平衡彎矩」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Unbalanced moment at pier head”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-21-k1","title":"平衡懸臂吊裝與全橋合龍","titleEn":"Balanced-cantilever erection and closure","text":"主橋與邊橋採懸臂工法：節塊從墩頂向兩側對稱吊裝，以預力鋼腱把新節塊壓緊在已完成的懸臂上，直到相鄰懸臂在跨中接近，再澆置合龍段使結構連續。施工中墩柱與基礎要承擔兩側重量差、吊裝設備與風荷載，常以臨時錨定、臨時支撐或墩梁臨時固結來穩定。","textEn":"The main and side bridges were built by the cantilever method: segments are erected symmetrically outward from each pier head and stressed against the completed cantilever until neighbouring cantilevers meet near mid-span, where a closure pour makes the girder continuous. During erection the pier and foundation carry the weight imbalance, lifting equipment and wind, usually stabilised by temporary ties, props or a temporary pier–girder fixity.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：平衡懸臂工法兩側永遠等重，所以墩柱不會受到彎矩。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: In balanced cantilever erection both sides are always equal, so the pier never sees bending. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「平衡懸臂吊裝與全橋合龍」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Balanced-cantilever erection and closure\" is correct?","options":["主橋與邊橋採懸臂工法：節塊從墩頂向兩側對稱吊裝，以預力鋼腱把新節塊壓緊在已完成的懸臂上，直到相鄰懸臂在跨中接近，再澆置合龍段使結構連續。","平衡懸臂工法兩側永遠等重，所以墩柱不會受到彎矩。","只要量到索的頻率，就能用同一個公式精確換算任何長度的索力。"],"optionsEn":["The main and side bridges were built by the cantilever method: segments are erected symmetrically outward from each pier head and stressed against the completed cantilever until neighbouring cantilevers meet near mid-span, where a closure pour makes the girder continuous.","In balanced cantilever erection both sides are always equal, so the pier never sees bending.","Once a stay's frequency is measured, one formula gives an exact force for any stay length."],"answer":0,"explanation":"主橋與邊橋採懸臂工法：節塊從墩頂向兩側對稱吊裝，以預力鋼腱把新節塊壓緊在已完成的懸臂上，直到相鄰懸臂在跨中接近，再澆置合龍段使結構連續。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The main and side bridges were built by the cantilever method: segments are erected symmetrically outward from each pier head and stressed against the completed cantilever until neighbouring cantilevers meet near mid-span, where a closure pour makes the girder continuous. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b002-v13-22","title":"平衡懸臂吊裝與全橋合龍：定量估算","titleEn":"Balanced-cantilever erection and closure: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「墩頂懸臂不平衡彎矩」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Unbalanced moment at pier head” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：一側先吊一塊 1,500 kN 節塊、距墩中心 95 m 時，不平衡彎矩 M = W·a = 1,500×95 = 142,500 kN·m；若臨時錨定的力臂為 4 m，需拉力約 142,500/4 ≈ 35,600 kN。節塊重量與力臂為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Lifting one 1,500 kN segment on one side at 95 m from the pier centre gives an unbalanced moment M = W·a = 1,500×95 = 142,500 kN·m; with a 4 m lever arm, the temporary tie must carry about 142,500/4 ≈ 35,600 kN. Segment weight and lever arm are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：每次吊裝前以施工階段分析核對允許的不平衡量，吊裝中量測墩頂傾斜與懸臂端高程；合龍前連續 24 小時量測兩懸臂端相對高程與間距隨溫度的變化，選擇溫度穩定時段鎖定合龍段並澆置。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before every lift, check the permitted imbalance against the construction-stage analysis, and monitor pier-head tilt and tip levels during lifting; before closure, record the relative level and gap of the two tips against temperature for 24 hours and lock and cast the closure in a thermally stable window.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"一側先吊一塊 1,500 kN 節塊、距墩中心 95 m 時，不平衡彎矩 M = W·a = 1,500×95 = 142,500 kN·m；若臨時錨定的力臂為 4 m，需拉力約 142,500/4 ≈ 35,600 kN。節塊重量與力臂為教學假設。","textEn":"Lifting one 1,500 kN segment on one side at 95 m from the pier centre gives an unbalanced moment M = W·a = 1,500×95 = 142,500 kN·m; with a 4 m lever arm, the temporary tie must carry about 142,500/4 ≈ 35,600 kN. Segment weight and lever arm are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「平衡懸臂吊裝與全橋合龍」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Balanced-cantilever erection and closure\", which statement holds?","options":["混凝土強度越高，就一定不會發生鋼筋腐蝕。","一側先吊一塊 1,500 kN 節塊、距墩中心 95 m 時，不平衡彎矩 M = W·a = 1,500×95 = 142,500 kN·m。","海上橋梁的基礎設計只要考慮完工後的營運荷載就足夠。"],"optionsEn":["Higher concrete strength alone guarantees the reinforcement will not corrode.","Lifting one 1,500 kN segment on one side at 95 m from the pier centre gives an unbalanced moment M = W·a = 1,500×95 = 142,500 kN·m.","Designing a marine bridge foundation only needs the in-service loads of the finished bridge."],"answer":1,"explanation":"一側先吊一塊 1,500 kN 節塊、距墩中心 95 m 時，不平衡彎矩 M = W·a = 1,500×95 = 142,500 kN·m；若臨時錨定的力臂為 4 m，需拉力約 142,500/4 ≈ 35,600 kN。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Lifting one 1,500 kN segment on one side at 95 m from the pier centre gives an unbalanced moment M = W·a = 1,500×95 = 142,500 kN·m; with a 4 m lever arm, the temporary tie must carry about 142,500/4 ≈ 35,600 kN. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b002-v13-23","title":"平衡懸臂吊裝與全橋合龍：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Balanced-cantilever erection and closure: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「墩頂懸臂不平衡彎矩」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Unbalanced moment at pier head” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"每次吊裝前以施工階段分析核對允許的不平衡量，吊裝中量測墩頂傾斜與懸臂端高程；合龍前連續 24 小時量測兩懸臂端相對高程與間距隨溫度的變化，選擇溫度穩定時段鎖定合龍段並澆置。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before every lift, check the permitted imbalance against the construction-stage analysis, and monitor pier-head tilt and tip levels during lifting; before closure, record the relative level and gap of the two tips against temperature for 24 hours and lock and cast the closure in a thermally stable window. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：施工計畫應明訂允許的最大不平衡節塊數、吊具重量與風速上限，合龍段設臨時鎖定裝置；合龍時段與預力張拉順序列為停留點，由設計單位與監造共同核准。","observationEn":"Site practice: The erection plan should state the maximum number of unbalanced segments, rigging weight and wind limit, and provide temporary locking at the closure; the closure window and stressing sequence are hold points approved jointly by the designer and the supervising engineer.","failure":"注意干擾：吊裝順序錯誤或一側吊具重量超出計畫，墩頂不平衡彎矩超過臨時錨定能力，懸臂可能傾覆；合龍時段選在日照急劇變化時，合龍段混凝土在硬化中受到拉伸而開裂。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A wrong lifting sequence or heavier rigging on one side can push the unbalanced moment past the temporary tie capacity and overturn the cantilever; closing during rapid solar heating can pull the closure concrete apart while it hardens and crack it. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"每次吊裝前以施工階段分析核對允許的不平衡量，吊裝中量測墩頂傾斜與懸臂端高程；合龍前連續 24 小時量測兩懸臂端相對高程與間距隨溫度的變化，選擇溫度穩定時段鎖定合龍段並澆置。","textEn":"Before every lift, check the permitted imbalance against the construction-stage analysis, and monitor pier-head tilt and tip levels during lifting; before closure, record the relative level and gap of the two tips against temperature for 24 hours and lock and cast the closure in a thermally stable window.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"施工計畫應明訂允許的最大不平衡節塊數、吊具重量與風速上限，合龍段設臨時鎖定裝置；合龍時段與預力張拉順序列為停留點，由設計單位與監造共同核准。","textEn":"The erection plan should state the maximum number of unbalanced segments, rigging weight and wind limit, and provide temporary locking at the closure; the closure window and stressing sequence are hold points approved jointly by the designer and the supervising engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「平衡懸臂吊裝與全橋合龍」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Balanced-cantilever erection and closure\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","只要基樁打到設計高程，就代表已經進入足夠的岩盤。","每次吊裝前以施工階段分析核對允許的不平衡量，吊裝中量測墩頂傾斜與懸臂端高程。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","Reaching the design toe level means the pile is socketed into enough rock.","Before every lift, check the permitted imbalance against the construction-stage analysis, and monitor pier-head tilt and tip levels during lifting."],"answer":2,"explanation":"每次吊裝前以施工階段分析核對允許的不平衡量，吊裝中量測墩頂傾斜與懸臂端高程；合龍前連續 24 小時量測兩懸臂端相對高程與間距隨溫度的變化，選擇溫度穩定時段鎖定合龍段並澆置。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before every lift, check the permitted imbalance against the construction-stage analysis, and monitor pier-head tilt and tip levels during lifting; before closure, record the relative level and gap of the two tips against temperature for 24 hours and lock and cast the closure in a thermally stable window. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b002-v13-24","title":"平衡懸臂吊裝與全橋合龍：失效診斷","titleEn":"Balanced-cantilever erection and closure: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「墩頂懸臂不平衡彎矩」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Unbalanced moment at pier head” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"吊裝順序錯誤或一側吊具重量超出計畫，墩頂不平衡彎矩超過臨時錨定能力，懸臂可能傾覆；合龍時段選在日照急劇變化時，合龍段混凝土在硬化中受到拉伸而開裂。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A wrong lifting sequence or heavier rigging on one side can push the unbalanced moment past the temporary tie capacity and overturn the cantilever; closing during rapid solar heating can pull the closure concrete apart while it hardens and crack it. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：金門大橋在 2022 年 7 月 22 日完成全橋合龍。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Kinmen Bridge achieved full closure on 22 July 2022.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「平衡懸臂工法兩側永遠等重，所以墩柱不會受到彎矩。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"In balanced cantilever erection both sides are always equal, so the pier never sees bending.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"吊裝順序錯誤或一側吊具重量超出計畫，墩頂不平衡彎矩超過臨時錨定能力，懸臂可能傾覆；合龍時段選在日照急劇變化時，合龍段混凝土在硬化中受到拉伸而開裂。","textEn":"A wrong lifting sequence or heavier rigging on one side can push the unbalanced moment past the temporary tie capacity and overturn the cantilever; closing during rapid solar heating can pull the closure concrete apart while it hardens and crack it.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「平衡懸臂吊裝與全橋合龍」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Balanced-cantilever erection and closure\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["吊裝順序錯誤或一側吊具重量超出計畫，墩頂不平衡彎矩超過臨時錨定能力，懸臂可能傾覆；合龍時段選在日照急劇變化時，合龍段混凝土在硬化中受到拉伸而開裂。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","只要量到索的頻率，就能用同一個公式精確換算任何長度的索力。"],"optionsEn":["A wrong lifting sequence or heavier rigging on one side can push the unbalanced moment past the temporary tie capacity and overturn the cantilever.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","Once a stay's frequency is measured, one formula gives an exact force for any stay length."],"answer":0,"explanation":"吊裝順序錯誤或一側吊具重量超出計畫，墩頂不平衡彎矩超過臨時錨定能力，懸臂可能傾覆；合龍時段選在日照急劇變化時，合龍段混凝土在硬化中受到拉伸而開裂。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A wrong lifting sequence or heavier rigging on one side can push the unbalanced moment past the temporary tie capacity and overturn the cantilever; closing during rapid solar heating can pull the closure concrete apart while it hardens and crack it. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b002-v13-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「脊背索索力量測與調整」與「線形驗收與通車前載重試驗」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Stay-force measurement and adjustment\" and \"Profile acceptance and pre-opening load test\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b002-v13-25","title":"脊背索索力量測與調整：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Stay-force measurement and adjustment: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-24"],"objective":"說明「脊背索頻率量測」如何影響金門大橋（金門）的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Stay frequency measurement” governs force, deformation or durability in “Kinmen Bridge”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"脊背索的初張力決定箱梁應力分布與線形，因此施工中與完工後都要量測索力。最常用的是振動法：以加速度計量測索的自然頻率，再由弦振動公式換算張力；但脊背索比斜張索短而粗，彎曲勁度、減振器與錨具邊界條件的影響較大，必須修正。另一種直接方法是以千斤頂做頂升試驗，量測錨頭開始離開承壓板時的油壓。兩種方法互相校正後，頻率法才適合用於長期監測。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「脊背索頻率量測」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The initial tension in the stays sets the girder's stress distribution and profile, so stay forces are measured during construction and after completion. The usual method is vibration-based: accelerometers record the stay's natural frequencies, which a taut-string formula converts to tension. Extradosed stays are shorter and stiffer than cable-stays, so bending stiffness, dampers and anchorage boundary conditions matter more and must be corrected. A direct alternative is the lift-off test, reading jack pressure when the anchor head just separates from its bearing plate. Only after the two methods are cross-calibrated is the frequency method fit for long-term monitoring. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Stay frequency measurement” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：張緊弦公式 T = 4·m·L²·f₁²。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Taut-string formula T = 4·m·L²·f₁².","failure":"常見誤解：「只要量到索的頻率，就能用同一個公式精確換算任何長度的索力。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Once a stay's frequency is measured, one formula gives an exact force for any stay length.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「脊背索頻率量測」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Stay frequency measurement”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-25-k1","title":"脊背索索力量測與調整","titleEn":"Stay-force measurement and adjustment","text":"脊背索的初張力決定箱梁應力分布與線形，因此施工中與完工後都要量測索力。最常用的是振動法：以加速度計量測索的自然頻率，再由弦振動公式換算張力；但脊背索比斜張索短而粗，彎曲勁度、減振器與錨具邊界條件的影響較大，必須修正。","textEn":"The initial tension in the stays sets the girder's stress distribution and profile, so stay forces are measured during construction and after completion. The usual method is vibration-based: accelerometers record the stay's natural frequencies, which a taut-string formula converts to tension.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要量到索的頻率，就能用同一個公式精確換算任何長度的索力。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Once a stay's frequency is measured, one formula gives an exact force for any stay length. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「脊背索索力量測與調整」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Stay-force measurement and adjustment\" is correct?","options":["只要量到索的頻率，就能用同一個公式精確換算任何長度的索力。","脊背索的初張力決定箱梁應力分布與線形，因此施工中與完工後都要量測索力。","載重試驗只要撓度小於計算值，就不必再檢查其他量測結果。"],"optionsEn":["Once a stay's frequency is measured, one formula gives an exact force for any stay length.","The initial tension in the stays sets the girder's stress distribution and profile, so stay forces are measured during construction and after completion.","If load-test deflections are below the calculated values, no other measurement needs checking."],"answer":1,"explanation":"脊背索的初張力決定箱梁應力分布與線形，因此施工中與完工後都要量測索力。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The initial tension in the stays sets the girder's stress distribution and profile, so stay forces are measured during construction and after completion. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b002-v13-26","title":"脊背索索力量測與調整：定量估算","titleEn":"Stay-force measurement and adjustment: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「脊背索頻率量測」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Stay frequency measurement” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：張緊弦公式 T = 4·m·L²·f₁²。取單位長質量 m = 60 kg/m、自由長度 L = 60 m、實測第一頻率 f₁ = 2.5 Hz：T = 4×60×60²×2.5² = 5,400,000 N ≈ 5.4 MN。因 T ∝ f²，頻率量測誤差 2% 會造成約 4% 的索力誤差。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Taut-string formula T = 4·m·L²·f₁². With m = 60 kg/m, free length L = 60 m and a measured first frequency f₁ = 2.5 Hz, T = 4×60×60²×2.5² = 5,400,000 N ≈ 5.4 MN. Because T ∝ f², a 2% frequency error gives about a 4% force error. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：每根索取前三階頻率，檢查是否接近整數倍以判斷彎曲勁度影響；抽樣以頂升試驗校正頻率法，記錄溫度與施工階段；與設計索力的差異須在規定允差內（例如 ±5%），否則依調索程序調整。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record the first three frequencies of each stay and check how close they are to integer multiples to judge bending-stiffness effects; calibrate the frequency method by lift-off tests on a sample, noting temperature and construction stage; deviations from design forces must be within the specified tolerance, such as ±5%, or the stay is adjusted under the retensioning procedure.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"張緊弦公式 T = 4·m·L²·f₁²。取單位長質量 m = 60 kg/m、自由長度 L = 60 m、實測第一頻率 f₁ = 2.5 Hz：T = 4×60×60²×2.5² = 5,400,000 N ≈ 5.4 MN。因 T ∝ f²，頻率量測誤差 2% 會造成約 4% 的索力誤差。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Taut-string formula T = 4·m·L²·f₁². With m = 60 kg/m, free length L = 60 m and a measured first frequency f₁ = 2.5 Hz, T = 4×60×60²×2.5² = 5,400,000 N ≈ 5.4 MN. Because T ∝ f², a 2% frequency error gives about a 4% force error. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「脊背索索力量測與調整」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Stay-force measurement and adjustment\", which statement holds?","options":["伸縮縫只是行車舒適性的配件，損壞時不影響結構。","脊背橋只是橋塔比較矮的斜張橋，設計方法完全一樣。","張緊弦公式 T = 4·m·L²·f₁²。"],"optionsEn":["Expansion joints only affect ride comfort, so their damage does not matter structurally.","An extradosed bridge is just a cable-stayed bridge with short towers and is designed the same way.","Taut-string formula T = 4·m·L²·f₁²."],"answer":2,"explanation":"張緊弦公式 T = 4·m·L²·f₁²。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Taut-string formula T = 4·m·L²·f₁². Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b002-v13-27","title":"脊背索索力量測與調整：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Stay-force measurement and adjustment: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「脊背索頻率量測」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Stay frequency measurement” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"每根索取前三階頻率，檢查是否接近整數倍以判斷彎曲勁度影響；抽樣以頂升試驗校正頻率法，記錄溫度與施工階段；與設計索力的差異須在規定允差內（例如 ±5%），否則依調索程序調整。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record the first three frequencies of each stay and check how close they are to integer multiples to judge bending-stiffness effects; calibrate the frequency method by lift-off tests on a sample, noting temperature and construction stage; deviations from design forces must be within the specified tolerance, such as ±5%, or the stay is adjusted under the retensioning procedure. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：索力驗收報告應附原始頻譜、採用的有效長度與修正方法、量測溫度與施工階段；調索須依設計提供的順序與允差執行，最終索力表由設計單位確認後納入竣工資料。","observationEn":"Site practice: The stay-force acceptance report should attach raw spectra, the effective length and correction method, temperature and construction stage; retensioning follows the designer's sequence and tolerances, and the final force table is confirmed by the designer and filed with the as-built records.","failure":"注意干擾：忽略彎曲勁度、減振器與套管對有效長度的影響時，短索換算索力可能偏差一成以上，據此調索反而使箱梁應力偏離設計；錨頭夾片咬合不良則會在長期使用後滑移，使索力逐年下降。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Ignoring bending stiffness and the effect of dampers and guide pipes on effective length can misjudge short-stay forces by more than ten percent, so retensioning on that basis drives girder stresses away from design; poorly seated wedges can slip over years of service and let the force decline. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"每根索取前三階頻率，檢查是否接近整數倍以判斷彎曲勁度影響；抽樣以頂升試驗校正頻率法，記錄溫度與施工階段；與設計索力的差異須在規定允差內（例如 ±5%），否則依調索程序調整。","textEn":"Record the first three frequencies of each stay and check how close they are to integer multiples to judge bending-stiffness effects; calibrate the frequency method by lift-off tests on a sample, noting temperature and construction stage; deviations from design forces must be within the specified tolerance, such as ±5%, or the stay is adjusted under the retensioning procedure.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"索力驗收報告應附原始頻譜、採用的有效長度與修正方法、量測溫度與施工階段；調索須依設計提供的順序與允差執行，最終索力表由設計單位確認後納入竣工資料。","textEn":"The stay-force acceptance report should attach raw spectra, the effective length and correction method, temperature and construction stage; retensioning follows the designer's sequence and tolerances, and the final force table is confirmed by the designer and filed with the as-built records.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「脊背索索力量測與調整」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Stay-force measurement and adjustment\"?","options":["每根索取前三階頻率，檢查是否接近整數倍以判斷彎曲勁度影響。","量測時不必記錄溫度、日照、風與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","鋼箱圍堰只是擋水的模板，抽水時不會產生很大的力。"],"optionsEn":["Record the first three frequencies of each stay and check how close they are to integer multiples to judge bending-stiffness effects.","Temperature, sunshine, wind and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A steel box cofferdam is only a formwork that keeps water out, so dewatering creates no large forces."],"answer":0,"explanation":"每根索取前三階頻率，檢查是否接近整數倍以判斷彎曲勁度影響；抽樣以頂升試驗校正頻率法，記錄溫度與施工階段；與設計索力的差異須在規定允差內（例如 ±5%），否則依調索程序調整。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record the first three frequencies of each stay and check how close they are to integer multiples to judge bending-stiffness effects; calibrate the frequency method by lift-off tests on a sample, noting temperature and construction stage; deviations from design forces must be within the specified tolerance, such as ±5%, or the stay is adjusted under the retensioning procedure. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b002-v13-28","title":"脊背索索力量測與調整：失效診斷","titleEn":"Stay-force measurement and adjustment: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「脊背索頻率量測」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Stay frequency measurement” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"忽略彎曲勁度、減振器與套管對有效長度的影響時，短索換算索力可能偏差一成以上，據此調索反而使箱梁應力偏離設計；錨頭夾片咬合不良則會在長期使用後滑移，使索力逐年下降。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Ignoring bending stiffness and the effect of dampers and guide pipes on effective length can misjudge short-stay forces by more than ten percent, so retensioning on that basis drives girder stresses away from design; poorly seated wedges can slip over years of service and let the force decline. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：兩種方法互相校正後，頻率法才適合用於長期監測。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Only after the two methods are cross-calibrated is the frequency method fit for long-term monitoring.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要量到索的頻率，就能用同一個公式精確換算任何長度的索力。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Once a stay's frequency is measured, one formula gives an exact force for any stay length.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"忽略彎曲勁度、減振器與套管對有效長度的影響時，短索換算索力可能偏差一成以上，據此調索反而使箱梁應力偏離設計；錨頭夾片咬合不良則會在長期使用後滑移，使索力逐年下降。","textEn":"Ignoring bending stiffness and the effect of dampers and guide pipes on effective length can misjudge short-stay forces by more than ten percent, so retensioning on that basis drives girder stresses away from design; poorly seated wedges can slip over years of service and let the force decline.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「脊背索索力量測與調整」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Stay-force measurement and adjustment\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","忽略彎曲勁度、減振器與套管對有效長度的影響時，短索換算索力可能偏差一成以上，據此調索反而使箱梁應力偏離設計。","載重試驗只要撓度小於計算值，就不必再檢查其他量測結果。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Ignoring bending stiffness and the effect of dampers and guide pipes on effective length can misjudge short-stay forces by more than ten percent, so retensioning on that basis drives girder stresses away from design.","If load-test deflections are below the calculated values, no other measurement needs checking."],"answer":1,"explanation":"忽略彎曲勁度、減振器與套管對有效長度的影響時，短索換算索力可能偏差一成以上，據此調索反而使箱梁應力偏離設計；錨頭夾片咬合不良則會在長期使用後滑移，使索力逐年下降。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Ignoring bending stiffness and the effect of dampers and guide pipes on effective length can misjudge short-stay forces by more than ten percent, so retensioning on that basis drives girder stresses away from design; poorly seated wedges can slip over years of service and let the force decline. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b002-v13-29","title":"線形驗收與通車前載重試驗：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Profile acceptance and pre-opening load test: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-28"],"objective":"說明「跨中撓度與校驗係數」如何影響金門大橋（金門）的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Mid-span deflection and check ratio” governs force, deformation or durability in “Kinmen Bridge”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"通車前要確認完成的橋梁與設計模型一致：一是線形，量測橋面高程與預拱是否符合考慮潛變後的目標；二是以已過磅的載重車做靜態與動態試驗，比對實測撓度、應變與自然頻率。實測值通常略小於計算值，因為實際混凝土勁度、鋪面與護欄都提供額外勁度；若實測大於計算，可能代表開裂、支承異常或模型假設錯誤。卸載後的殘餘變形也很重要，它顯示結構是否仍在彈性範圍。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「跨中撓度與校驗係數」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Before opening, engineers confirm that the finished bridge matches the design model: first the profile, checking deck levels and camber against targets that allow for creep; second, static and dynamic tests with weighed trucks, comparing measured deflections, strains and natural frequencies. Measured values are usually slightly below predictions because actual concrete stiffness, surfacing and barriers add stiffness; values above prediction may signal cracking, bearing problems or wrong model assumptions. Residual deformation after unloading also matters, showing whether the structure stayed elastic. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Mid-span deflection and check ratio” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：校驗係數 η = 實測/計算。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Check ratio η = measured/calculated.","failure":"常見誤解：「載重試驗只要撓度小於計算值，就不必再檢查其他量測結果。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"If load-test deflections are below the calculated values, no other measurement needs checking.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「跨中撓度與校驗係數」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Mid-span deflection and check ratio”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-29-k1","title":"線形驗收與通車前載重試驗","titleEn":"Profile acceptance and pre-opening load test","text":"通車前要確認完成的橋梁與設計模型一致：一是線形，量測橋面高程與預拱是否符合考慮潛變後的目標；二是以已過磅的載重車做靜態與動態試驗，比對實測撓度、應變與自然頻率。實測值通常略小於計算值，因為實際混凝土勁度、鋪面與護欄都提供額外勁度；若實測大於計算，可能代表開裂、支承異常或模型假設錯誤。","textEn":"Before opening, engineers confirm that the finished bridge matches the design model: first the profile, checking deck levels and camber against targets that allow for creep; second, static and dynamic tests with weighed trucks, comparing measured deflections, strains and natural frequencies. Measured values are usually slightly below predictions because actual concrete stiffness, surfacing and barriers add stiffness; values above prediction may signal cracking, bearing problems or wrong model assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：載重試驗只要撓度小於計算值，就不必再檢查其他量測結果。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: If load-test deflections are below the calculated values, no other measurement needs checking. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「線形驗收與通車前載重試驗」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Profile acceptance and pre-opening load test\" is correct?","options":["載重試驗只要撓度小於計算值，就不必再檢查其他量測結果。","混凝土強度越高，就一定不會發生鋼筋腐蝕。","通車前要確認完成的橋梁與設計模型一致：一是線形，量測橋面高程與預拱是否符合考慮潛變後的目標；二是以已過磅的載重車做靜態與動態試驗，比對實測撓度、應變與自然頻率。"],"optionsEn":["If load-test deflections are below the calculated values, no other measurement needs checking.","Higher concrete strength alone guarantees the reinforcement will not corrode.","Before opening, engineers confirm that the finished bridge matches the design model: first the profile, checking deck levels and camber against targets that allow for creep."],"answer":2,"explanation":"通車前要確認完成的橋梁與設計模型一致：一是線形，量測橋面高程與預拱是否符合考慮潛變後的目標；二是以已過磅的載重車做靜態與動態試驗，比對實測撓度、應變與自然頻率。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Before opening, engineers confirm that the finished bridge matches the design model: first the profile, checking deck levels and camber against targets that allow for creep; second, static and dynamic tests with weighed trucks, comparing measured deflections, strains and natural frequencies. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b002-v13-30","title":"線形驗收與通車前載重試驗：定量估算","titleEn":"Profile acceptance and pre-opening load test: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「跨中撓度與校驗係數」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Mid-span deflection and check ratio” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：校驗係數 η = 實測/計算。某 200 m 跨跨中計算撓度 45 mm、實測 38 mm，η = 38/45 ≈ 0.84；卸載後殘餘 3 mm，殘餘比 3/38 ≈ 7.9%。預拱量級可由懸臂端 δ = P·L³/(3EI) 估計：P = 1,500 kN、L = 95 m、E = 35 GPa、I = 150 m⁴，δ ≈ 82 mm。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Check ratio η = measured/calculated. A 200 m span with 45 mm calculated and 38 mm measured mid-span deflection gives η = 38/45 ≈ 0.84; 3 mm residual after unloading gives 3/38 ≈ 7.9%. Camber magnitude can be estimated from a cantilever tip δ = P·L³/(3EI) with P = 1,500 kN, L = 95 m, E = 35 GPa and I = 150 m⁴, giving δ ≈ 82 mm. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：試驗前依有限元素模型決定車位與加載分級，先預載消除間隙；量測採精密水準、全站儀或位移計並同步記錄溫度。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Set truck positions and load steps from the finite-element model, preload to close gaps, then measure with precise levelling, total stations or displacement transducers while recording temperature.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"校驗係數 η = 實測/計算。某 200 m 跨跨中計算撓度 45 mm、實測 38 mm，η = 38/45 ≈ 0.84；卸載後殘餘 3 mm，殘餘比 3/38 ≈ 7.9%。預拱量級可由懸臂端 δ = P·L³/(3EI) 估計：P = 1,500 kN、L = 95 m、E = 35 GPa、I = 150 m⁴，δ ≈ 82 mm。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Check ratio η = measured/calculated. A 200 m span with 45 mm calculated and 38 mm measured mid-span deflection gives η = 38/45 ≈ 0.84; 3 mm residual after unloading gives 3/38 ≈ 7.9%. Camber magnitude can be estimated from a cantilever tip δ = P·L³/(3EI) with P = 1,500 kN, L = 95 m, E = 35 GPa and I = 150 m⁴, giving δ ≈ 82 mm. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「線形驗收與通車前載重試驗」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Profile acceptance and pre-opening load test\", which statement holds?","options":["校驗係數 η = 實測/計算。","海上橋梁的基礎設計只要考慮完工後的營運荷載就足夠。","只要基樁打到設計高程，就代表已經進入足夠的岩盤。"],"optionsEn":["Check ratio η = measured/calculated.","Designing a marine bridge foundation only needs the in-service loads of the finished bridge.","Reaching the design toe level means the pile is socketed into enough rock."],"answer":0,"explanation":"校驗係數 η = 實測/計算。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Check ratio η = measured/calculated. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b002-v13-31","title":"線形驗收與通車前載重試驗：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Profile acceptance and pre-opening load test: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「跨中撓度與校驗係數」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Mid-span deflection and check ratio” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"試驗前依有限元素模型決定車位與加載分級，先預載消除間隙；量測採精密水準、全站儀或位移計並同步記錄溫度。允收常以校驗係數小於 1.0、殘餘比低於規定值（例如 20%）且無新增裂縫為準，結果寫入竣工基準資料。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Set truck positions and load steps from the finite-element model, preload to close gaps, then measure with precise levelling, total stations or displacement transducers while recording temperature. Acceptance usually requires a check ratio below 1.0, a residual ratio below the specified value such as 20% and no new cracks; the results enter the as-built baseline. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：載重試驗計畫須明訂車輛過磅、分級加載、每級穩定時間、停止條件與允收標準，並把試驗結果、線形量測與索力表一起納入竣工基準檔案，作為日後監測比較的起點。","observationEn":"Site practice: The load-test plan must specify truck weighing, load steps, hold time per step, stop criteria and acceptance limits, and the results go into the as-built baseline together with the profile survey and stay-force table as the starting point for future monitoring.","failure":"注意干擾：試驗在日照強烈時進行而未做溫度修正，熱變形可能與載重撓度同量級而造成誤判；載重車未逐輛過磅，計算值本身就有誤差，校驗係數失去意義。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Testing in strong sun without temperature correction can produce thermal movements as large as the load deflection and lead to misjudgement; trucks not individually weighed make the calculated values wrong and the check ratio meaningless. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"試驗前依有限元素模型決定車位與加載分級，先預載消除間隙；量測採精密水準、全站儀或位移計並同步記錄溫度。允收常以校驗係數小於 1.0、殘餘比低於規定值（例如 20%）且無新增裂縫為準，結果寫入竣工基準資料。","textEn":"Set truck positions and load steps from the finite-element model, preload to close gaps, then measure with precise levelling, total stations or displacement transducers while recording temperature. Acceptance usually requires a check ratio below 1.0, a residual ratio below the specified value such as 20% and no new cracks; the results enter the as-built baseline.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"載重試驗計畫須明訂車輛過磅、分級加載、每級穩定時間、停止條件與允收標準，並把試驗結果、線形量測與索力表一起納入竣工基準檔案，作為日後監測比較的起點。","textEn":"The load-test plan must specify truck weighing, load steps, hold time per step, stop criteria and acceptance limits, and the results go into the as-built baseline together with the profile survey and stay-force table as the starting point for future monitoring.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「線形驗收與通車前載重試驗」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Profile acceptance and pre-opening load test\"?","options":["沿用另一座橋或另一棟建築的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","試驗前依有限元素模型決定車位與加載分級，先預載消除間隙；量測採精密水準、全站儀或位移計並同步記錄溫度。","預鑄節塊在工廠做得很精準，現場就不需要幾何控制。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another bridge or building counts as verifying this structure.","Set truck positions and load steps from the finite-element model, preload to close gaps, then measure with precise levelling, total stations or displacement transducers while recording temperature.","Factory-precast segments are so precise that no geometry control is needed on site."],"answer":1,"explanation":"試驗前依有限元素模型決定車位與加載分級，先預載消除間隙；量測採精密水準、全站儀或位移計並同步記錄溫度。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Set truck positions and load steps from the finite-element model, preload to close gaps, then measure with precise levelling, total stations or displacement transducers while recording temperature. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b002-v13-32","title":"線形驗收與通車前載重試驗：失效診斷","titleEn":"Profile acceptance and pre-opening load test: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「跨中撓度與校驗係數」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Mid-span deflection and check ratio” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"試驗在日照強烈時進行而未做溫度修正，熱變形可能與載重撓度同量級而造成誤判；載重車未逐輛過磅，計算值本身就有誤差，校驗係數失去意義。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Testing in strong sun without temperature correction can produce thermal movements as large as the load deflection and lead to misjudgement; trucks not individually weighed make the calculated values wrong and the check ratio meaningless. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：卸載後的殘餘變形也很重要，它顯示結構是否仍在彈性範圍。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Residual deformation after unloading also matters, showing whether the structure stayed elastic.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「載重試驗只要撓度小於計算值，就不必再檢查其他量測結果。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"If load-test deflections are below the calculated values, no other measurement needs checking.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"試驗在日照強烈時進行而未做溫度修正，熱變形可能與載重撓度同量級而造成誤判；載重車未逐輛過磅，計算值本身就有誤差，校驗係數失去意義。","textEn":"Testing in strong sun without temperature correction can produce thermal movements as large as the load deflection and lead to misjudgement; trucks not individually weighed make the calculated values wrong and the check ratio meaningless.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「線形驗收與通車前載重試驗」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Profile acceptance and pre-opening load test\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","混凝土強度越高，就一定不會發生鋼筋腐蝕。","試驗在日照強烈時進行而未做溫度修正，熱變形可能與載重撓度同量級而造成誤判；載重車未逐輛過磅，計算值本身就有誤差，校驗係數失去意義。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Higher concrete strength alone guarantees the reinforcement will not corrode.","Testing in strong sun without temperature correction can produce thermal movements as large as the load deflection and lead to misjudgement."],"answer":2,"explanation":"試驗在日照強烈時進行而未做溫度修正，熱變形可能與載重撓度同量級而造成誤判；載重車未逐輛過磅，計算值本身就有誤差，校驗係數失去意義。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Testing in strong sun without temperature correction can produce thermal movements as large as the load deflection and lead to misjudgement; trucks not individually weighed make the calculated values wrong and the check ratio meaningless. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b002-v13-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「海峽環境的混凝土耐久設計」與「伸縮縫、支承與營運交接」：先建立傳力機制與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Concrete durability in the strait\" and \"Joints, bearings and operational handover\": build the load path and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b002-v13-33","title":"海峽環境的混凝土耐久設計：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Concrete durability in the strait: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-32"],"objective":"說明「混凝土保護層與氯離子」如何影響金門大橋（金門）的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Concrete cover and chlorides” governs force, deformation or durability in “Kinmen Bridge”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"金門大橋位於海峽中，飛沫帶與潮汐帶的混凝土同時受氯離子滲透、乾濕循環與鹽霧作用；氯離子到達鋼筋位置並超過臨界含量後，鈍化膜破壞，鋼筋開始腐蝕，鏽蝕膨脹使保護層剝落。耐久對策包括加大保護層、降低水膠比、使用卜作嵐材料降低擴散係數、環氧樹脂塗布或耐蝕鋼筋、表面保護與陰極防蝕，2013 年國道新建工程局的考察報告也列出這些方向。不同高程的暴露差異很大，墩柱潮汐帶與樁帽頂面通常最嚴重。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「混凝土保護層與氯離子」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Kinmen Bridge stands in a strait where concrete in the splash and tidal zones suffers chloride ingress, wetting and drying and salt spray; once chlorides reach the reinforcement above a critical content, the passive film breaks down, the bars corrode and expanding rust spalls the cover. Countermeasures include larger cover, lower water–binder ratio, pozzolans to lower diffusivity, epoxy-coated or corrosion-resistant bars, surface protection and cathodic protection, directions also listed in a 2013 study report of the national expressway engineering bureau. Exposure varies strongly with elevation, and the tidal zone of piers and the top of pile caps are usually worst. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Concrete cover and chlorides” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：Fick 第二定律 C(x,t) = C_s·[1 − erf(x/(2√(D·t)))]。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Fick's second law C(x,t) = C_s·[1 − erf(x/(2√(D·t)))].","failure":"常見誤解：「混凝土強度越高，就一定不會發生鋼筋腐蝕。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Higher concrete strength alone guarantees the reinforcement will not corrode.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「混凝土保護層與氯離子」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Concrete cover and chlorides”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-33-k1","title":"海峽環境的混凝土耐久設計","titleEn":"Concrete durability in the strait","text":"金門大橋位於海峽中，飛沫帶與潮汐帶的混凝土同時受氯離子滲透、乾濕循環與鹽霧作用；氯離子到達鋼筋位置並超過臨界含量後，鈍化膜破壞，鋼筋開始腐蝕，鏽蝕膨脹使保護層剝落。耐久對策包括加大保護層、降低水膠比、使用卜作嵐材料降低擴散係數、環氧樹脂塗布或耐蝕鋼筋、表面保護與陰極防蝕，2013 年國道新建工程局的考察報告也列出這些方向。","textEn":"Kinmen Bridge stands in a strait where concrete in the splash and tidal zones suffers chloride ingress, wetting and drying and salt spray; once chlorides reach the reinforcement above a critical content, the passive film breaks down, the bars corrode and expanding rust spalls the cover. Countermeasures include larger cover, lower water–binder ratio, pozzolans to lower diffusivity, epoxy-coated or corrosion-resistant bars, surface protection and cathodic protection, directions also listed in a 2013 study report of the national expressway engineering bureau.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：混凝土強度越高，就一定不會發生鋼筋腐蝕。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Higher concrete strength alone guarantees the reinforcement will not corrode. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「海峽環境的混凝土耐久設計」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Concrete durability in the strait\" is correct?","options":["金門大橋位於海峽中，飛沫帶與潮汐帶的混凝土同時受氯離子滲透、乾濕循環與鹽霧作用。","混凝土強度越高，就一定不會發生鋼筋腐蝕。","伸縮縫只是行車舒適性的配件，損壞時不影響結構。"],"optionsEn":["Kinmen Bridge stands in a strait where concrete in the splash and tidal zones suffers chloride ingress, wetting and drying and salt spray.","Higher concrete strength alone guarantees the reinforcement will not corrode.","Expansion joints only affect ride comfort, so their damage does not matter structurally."],"answer":0,"explanation":"金門大橋位於海峽中，飛沫帶與潮汐帶的混凝土同時受氯離子滲透、乾濕循環與鹽霧作用；氯離子到達鋼筋位置並超過臨界含量後，鈍化膜破壞，鋼筋開始腐蝕，鏽蝕膨脹使保護層剝落。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Kinmen Bridge stands in a strait where concrete in the splash and tidal zones suffers chloride ingress, wetting and drying and salt spray; once chlorides reach the reinforcement above a critical content, the passive film breaks down, the bars corrode and expanding rust spalls the cover. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b002-v13-34","title":"海峽環境的混凝土耐久設計：定量估算","titleEn":"Concrete durability in the strait: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「混凝土保護層與氯離子」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Concrete cover and chlorides” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：Fick 第二定律 C(x,t) = C_s·[1 − erf(x/(2√(D·t)))]。取保護層 x = 75 mm、擴散係數 D = 1×10⁻¹² m²/s、t = 100 年：√(D·t) ≈ 0.0562 m，x/(2√(D·t)) ≈ 0.668，C/C_s ≈ 0.345；若 D 為 3×10⁻¹² m²/s，C/C_s 升到約 0.586。數值為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Fick's second law C(x,t) = C_s·[1 − erf(x/(2√(D·t)))]. With cover x = 75 mm, diffusivity D = 1×10⁻¹² m²/s and t = 100 years, √(D·t) ≈ 0.0562 m, x/(2√(D·t)) ≈ 0.668 and C/C_s ≈ 0.345; with D = 3×10⁻¹² m²/s, C/C_s rises to about 0.586. Values are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：施工時以保護層測定儀抽檢鋼筋保護層，以快速氯離子滲透或擴散試驗驗證配比；營運後定期在潮汐帶與飛沫帶鑽取粉末，量測氯離子濃度剖面並擬合實際擴散係數，與設計假設比較。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: During construction, spot-check cover with a covermeter and verify the mix by rapid chloride permeability or diffusion tests; in service, periodically drill powder samples in the tidal and splash zones, measure chloride profiles, fit the actual diffusivity and compare it with the design assumption.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"Fick 第二定律 C(x,t) = C_s·[1 − erf(x/(2√(D·t)))]。取保護層 x = 75 mm、擴散係數 D = 1×10⁻¹² m²/s、t = 100 年：√(D·t) ≈ 0.0562 m，x/(2√(D·t)) ≈ 0.668，C/C_s ≈ 0.345；若 D 為 3×10⁻¹² m²/s，C/C_s 升到約 0.586。數值為教學假設。","textEn":"Fick's second law C(x,t) = C_s·[1 − erf(x/(2√(D·t)))]. With cover x = 75 mm, diffusivity D = 1×10⁻¹² m²/s and t = 100 years, √(D·t) ≈ 0.0562 m, x/(2√(D·t)) ≈ 0.668 and C/C_s ≈ 0.345; with D = 3×10⁻¹² m²/s, C/C_s rises to about 0.586. Values are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「海峽環境的混凝土耐久設計」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Concrete durability in the strait\", which statement holds?","options":["脊背橋只是橋塔比較矮的斜張橋，設計方法完全一樣。","Fick 第二定律 C(x,t) = C_s·[1 − erf(x/(2√(D·t)))]。","鋼箱圍堰只是擋水的模板，抽水時不會產生很大的力。"],"optionsEn":["An extradosed bridge is just a cable-stayed bridge with short towers and is designed the same way.","Fick's second law C(x,t) = C_s·[1 − erf(x/(2√(D·t)))].","A steel box cofferdam is only a formwork that keeps water out, so dewatering creates no large forces."],"answer":1,"explanation":"Fick 第二定律 C(x,t) = C_s·[1 − erf(x/(2√(D·t)))]。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Fick's second law C(x,t) = C_s·[1 − erf(x/(2√(D·t)))]. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b002-v13-35","title":"海峽環境的混凝土耐久設計：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Concrete durability in the strait: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「混凝土保護層與氯離子」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Concrete cover and chlorides” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"施工時以保護層測定儀抽檢鋼筋保護層，以快速氯離子滲透或擴散試驗驗證配比；營運後定期在潮汐帶與飛沫帶鑽取粉末，量測氯離子濃度剖面並擬合實際擴散係數，與設計假設比較。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"During construction, spot-check cover with a covermeter and verify the mix by rapid chloride permeability or diffusion tests; in service, periodically drill powder samples in the tidal and splash zones, measure chloride profiles, fit the actual diffusivity and compare it with the design assumption. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：施工規範應把保護層量測與間隔物檢查列為澆置前停留點，潮汐帶的接縫與修補須使用經認可的材料；在代表性位置預埋耐久監測探頭或預留取樣點，建立長期氯離子資料。","observationEn":"Site practice: The specification should make cover measurement and spacer inspection a hold point before concreting, and require approved materials for joints and repairs in the tidal zone; durability probes or sampling points at representative locations build a long-term chloride record.","failure":"注意干擾：保護層不足或局部蜂窩處，氯離子在十幾年內就到達鋼筋，出現鏽水、裂縫與剝落；樁帽頂面若排水不良、乾濕交替，腐蝕會集中在不易檢查的部位，發現時已需大範圍修補。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Where cover is thin or honeycombed, chlorides reach the steel within a decade or two, causing rust stains, cracks and spalls; poorly drained pile-cap tops that wet and dry concentrate corrosion where inspection is hard, so damage is found only when large repairs are needed. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"施工時以保護層測定儀抽檢鋼筋保護層，以快速氯離子滲透或擴散試驗驗證配比；營運後定期在潮汐帶與飛沫帶鑽取粉末，量測氯離子濃度剖面並擬合實際擴散係數，與設計假設比較。","textEn":"During construction, spot-check cover with a covermeter and verify the mix by rapid chloride permeability or diffusion tests; in service, periodically drill powder samples in the tidal and splash zones, measure chloride profiles, fit the actual diffusivity and compare it with the design assumption.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"施工規範應把保護層量測與間隔物檢查列為澆置前停留點，潮汐帶的接縫與修補須使用經認可的材料；在代表性位置預埋耐久監測探頭或預留取樣點，建立長期氯離子資料。","textEn":"The specification should make cover measurement and spacer inspection a hold point before concreting, and require approved materials for joints and repairs in the tidal zone; durability probes or sampling points at representative locations build a long-term chloride record.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「海峽環境的混凝土耐久設計」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Concrete durability in the strait\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","平衡懸臂工法兩側永遠等重，所以墩柱不會受到彎矩。","施工時以保護層測定儀抽檢鋼筋保護層，以快速氯離子滲透或擴散試驗驗證配比。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","In balanced cantilever erection both sides are always equal, so the pier never sees bending.","During construction, spot-check cover with a covermeter and verify the mix by rapid chloride permeability or diffusion tests."],"answer":2,"explanation":"施工時以保護層測定儀抽檢鋼筋保護層，以快速氯離子滲透或擴散試驗驗證配比；營運後定期在潮汐帶與飛沫帶鑽取粉末，量測氯離子濃度剖面並擬合實際擴散係數，與設計假設比較。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"During construction, spot-check cover with a covermeter and verify the mix by rapid chloride permeability or diffusion tests; in service, periodically drill powder samples in the tidal and splash zones, measure chloride profiles, fit the actual diffusivity and compare it with the design assumption. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b002-v13-36","title":"海峽環境的混凝土耐久設計：失效診斷","titleEn":"Concrete durability in the strait: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「混凝土保護層與氯離子」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Concrete cover and chlorides” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"保護層不足或局部蜂窩處，氯離子在十幾年內就到達鋼筋，出現鏽水、裂縫與剝落；樁帽頂面若排水不良、乾濕交替，腐蝕會集中在不易檢查的部位，發現時已需大範圍修補。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Where cover is thin or honeycombed, chlorides reach the steel within a decade or two, causing rust stains, cracks and spalls; poorly drained pile-cap tops that wet and dry concentrate corrosion where inspection is hard, so damage is found only when large repairs are needed. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：不同高程的暴露差異很大，墩柱潮汐帶與樁帽頂面通常最嚴重。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Exposure varies strongly with elevation, and the tidal zone of piers and the top of pile caps are usually worst.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「混凝土強度越高，就一定不會發生鋼筋腐蝕。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Higher concrete strength alone guarantees the reinforcement will not corrode.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"保護層不足或局部蜂窩處，氯離子在十幾年內就到達鋼筋，出現鏽水、裂縫與剝落；樁帽頂面若排水不良、乾濕交替，腐蝕會集中在不易檢查的部位，發現時已需大範圍修補。","textEn":"Where cover is thin or honeycombed, chlorides reach the steel within a decade or two, causing rust stains, cracks and spalls; poorly drained pile-cap tops that wet and dry concentrate corrosion where inspection is hard, so damage is found only when large repairs are needed.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「海峽環境的混凝土耐久設計」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Concrete durability in the strait\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["保護層不足或局部蜂窩處，氯離子在十幾年內就到達鋼筋，出現鏽水、裂縫與剝落；樁帽頂面若排水不良、乾濕交替，腐蝕會集中在不易檢查的部位，發現時已需大範圍修補。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","伸縮縫只是行車舒適性的配件，損壞時不影響結構。"],"optionsEn":["Where cover is thin or honeycombed, chlorides reach the steel within a decade or two, causing rust stains, cracks and spalls.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Expansion joints only affect ride comfort, so their damage does not matter structurally."],"answer":0,"explanation":"保護層不足或局部蜂窩處，氯離子在十幾年內就到達鋼筋，出現鏽水、裂縫與剝落；樁帽頂面若排水不良、乾濕交替，腐蝕會集中在不易檢查的部位，發現時已需大範圍修補。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Where cover is thin or honeycombed, chlorides reach the steel within a decade or two, causing rust stains, cracks and spalls; poorly drained pile-cap tops that wet and dry concentrate corrosion where inspection is hard, so damage is found only when large repairs are needed. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b002-v13-37","title":"伸縮縫、支承與營運交接：機制與傳力路徑","titleEn":"Joints, bearings and operational handover: mechanism and load path","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-36"],"objective":"說明「伸縮縫與支承行程」如何影響金門大橋（金門）的受力、變形或耐久表現，並畫出荷載的來源、傳遞路徑與支承邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Joint and bearing travel” governs force, deformation or durability in “Kinmen Bridge”, and map where loads come from, how they travel and where they are supported.","instruction":"全橋由主橋、兩側邊橋與多個引橋單元組成，各單元之間以伸縮縫分隔，支承配置決定每個單元哪裡固定、哪裡可滑動。溫度、乾縮與潛變讓梁體長度持續變化，伸縮縫與滑動支承必須提供足夠行程，同時承受車輛衝擊與鹽霧侵蝕。交接時管理單位需要的不只是竣工圖，還包括各單元固定點位置、支承與伸縮縫設計行程、竣工時的初始開口與當時溫度，作為日後判斷異常位移的基準；公開報導也提到通車後將依強風情況實施交通管制。 師傅任務：以自由體圖或傳力路徑圖畫出荷載如何經過「伸縮縫與支承行程」傳到支承或基礎，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The crossing consists of the main bridge, two side bridges and several approach units separated by expansion joints, and the bearing layout decides where each unit is fixed and where it slides. Temperature, shrinkage and creep keep changing girder length, so joints and sliding bearings need enough travel while resisting traffic impact and salt spray. At handover the operator needs more than as-built drawings: the fixed point of each unit, design travel of bearings and joints, and the initial joint openings with the temperature at completion, as the baseline for spotting abnormal movement; public reports also note traffic control during strong winds after opening. Mentor task: draw a free-body or load-path diagram showing how loads pass through “Joint and bearing travel” to the supports or foundation, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：假設一個 1,050 m 連續單元以中央為不動點，端部受影響長度 525 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Assume a 1,050 m continuous unit fixed at its centre, so 525 m acts on each end.","failure":"常見誤解：「伸縮縫只是行車舒適性的配件，損壞時不影響結構。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在傳力圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Expansion joints only affect ride comfort, so their damage does not matter structurally.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your load-path diagram where it breaks down.","check":"傳力圖標明「伸縮縫與支承行程」的荷載來源、傳遞路徑與支承；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The load-path diagram shows load sources, path and supports for “Joint and bearing travel”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-37-k1","title":"伸縮縫、支承與營運交接","titleEn":"Joints, bearings and operational handover","text":"全橋由主橋、兩側邊橋與多個引橋單元組成，各單元之間以伸縮縫分隔，支承配置決定每個單元哪裡固定、哪裡可滑動。溫度、乾縮與潛變讓梁體長度持續變化，伸縮縫與滑動支承必須提供足夠行程，同時承受車輛衝擊與鹽霧侵蝕。","textEn":"The crossing consists of the main bridge, two side bridges and several approach units separated by expansion joints, and the bearing layout decides where each unit is fixed and where it slides. Temperature, shrinkage and creep keep changing girder length, so joints and sliding bearings need enough travel while resisting traffic impact and salt spray.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：伸縮縫只是行車舒適性的配件，損壞時不影響結構。 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Expansion joints only affect ride comfort, so their damage does not matter structurally. Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「伸縮縫、支承與營運交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Joints, bearings and operational handover\" is correct?","options":["伸縮縫只是行車舒適性的配件，損壞時不影響結構。","全橋由主橋、兩側邊橋與多個引橋單元組成，各單元之間以伸縮縫分隔，支承配置決定每個單元哪裡固定、哪裡可滑動。","海上橋梁的基礎設計只要考慮完工後的營運荷載就足夠。"],"optionsEn":["Expansion joints only affect ride comfort, so their damage does not matter structurally.","The crossing consists of the main bridge, two side bridges and several approach units separated by expansion joints, and the bearing layout decides where each unit is fixed and where it slides.","Designing a marine bridge foundation only needs the in-service loads of the finished bridge."],"answer":1,"explanation":"全橋由主橋、兩側邊橋與多個引橋單元組成，各單元之間以伸縮縫分隔，支承配置決定每個單元哪裡固定、哪裡可滑動。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The crossing consists of the main bridge, two side bridges and several approach units separated by expansion joints, and the bearing layout decides where each unit is fixed and where it slides. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b002-v13-38","title":"伸縮縫、支承與營運交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Joints, bearings and operational handover: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「伸縮縫與支承行程」的關鍵量，並判斷跨度、荷載、溫度或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Joint and bearing travel” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when span, load, temperature or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：假設一個 1,050 m 連續單元以中央為不動點，端部受影響長度 525 m。溫度變化 30 °C：ΔL = α·L·ΔT = 1.0×10⁻⁵×525×30 ≈ 0.158 m；乾縮與潛變應變 250×10⁻⁶：250×10⁻⁶×525 ≈ 0.131 m，伸縮縫需涵蓋兩者再加安裝誤差。單元劃分與參數為教學假設。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Assume a 1,050 m continuous unit fixed at its centre, so 525 m acts on each end. A 30 °C change gives ΔL = α·L·ΔT = 1.0×10⁻⁵×525×30 ≈ 0.158 m; shrinkage and creep strain of 250×10⁻⁶ add 250×10⁻⁶×525 ≈ 0.131 m, and the joint must cover both plus installation tolerance. Unit layout and parameters are teaching assumptions. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：竣工時記錄每道伸縮縫開口與當時梁溫；營運後在不同季節重測，繪出開口與溫度的關係，斜率應接近 α·L，若偏離或出現持續漂移，代表支承卡滯或墩柱位移。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Record every joint opening with girder temperature at completion; re-measure in different seasons and plot opening against temperature, whose slope should approach α·L, while deviation or steady drift signals seized bearings or pier movement.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"假設一個 1,050 m 連續單元以中央為不動點，端部受影響長度 525 m。溫度變化 30 °C：ΔL = α·L·ΔT = 1.0×10⁻⁵×525×30 ≈ 0.158 m；乾縮與潛變應變 250×10⁻⁶：250×10⁻⁶×525 ≈ 0.131 m，伸縮縫需涵蓋兩者再加安裝誤差。單元劃分與參數為教學假設。","textEn":"Assume a 1,050 m continuous unit fixed at its centre, so 525 m acts on each end. A 30 °C change gives ΔL = α·L·ΔT = 1.0×10⁻⁵×525×30 ≈ 0.158 m; shrinkage and creep strain of 250×10⁻⁶ add 250×10⁻⁶×525 ≈ 0.131 m, and the joint must cover both plus installation tolerance. Unit layout and parameters are teaching assumptions.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「伸縮縫、支承與營運交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Joints, bearings and operational handover\", which statement holds?","options":["只要基樁打到設計高程，就代表已經進入足夠的岩盤。","預鑄節塊在工廠做得很精準，現場就不需要幾何控制。","假設一個 1,050 m 連續單元以中央為不動點，端部受影響長度 525 m。"],"optionsEn":["Reaching the design toe level means the pile is socketed into enough rock.","Factory-precast segments are so precise that no geometry control is needed on site.","Assume a 1,050 m continuous unit fixed at its centre, so 525 m acts on each end."],"answer":2,"explanation":"假設一個 1,050 m 連續單元以中央為不動點，端部受影響長度 525 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Assume a 1,050 m continuous unit fixed at its centre, so 525 m acts on each end. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b002-v13-39","title":"伸縮縫、支承與營運交接：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Joints, bearings and operational handover: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「伸縮縫與支承行程」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Joint and bearing travel” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"竣工時記錄每道伸縮縫開口與當時梁溫；營運後在不同季節重測，繪出開口與溫度的關係，斜率應接近 α·L，若偏離或出現持續漂移，代表支承卡滯或墩柱位移。支承檢查滑動面磨耗、錨栓與防塵罩。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Record every joint opening with girder temperature at completion; re-measure in different seasons and plot opening against temperature, whose slope should approach α·L, while deviation or steady drift signals seized bearings or pier movement. Inspect bearing sliding surfaces for wear, anchor bolts and dust covers. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接清冊應包含伸縮縫與支承的型號、行程、初始設定與溫度、更換程序與交通維持計畫，以及索力基準與載重試驗資料；並約定巡查週期與颱風、地震後的特別檢查表，明訂由哪個單位簽認。","observationEn":"Site practice: The handover register should list joint and bearing types, travel, initial settings and temperatures, replacement procedures and traffic-management plans, together with the stay-force baseline and load-test data; it should also fix inspection intervals and special post-typhoon and post-earthquake checklists, naming who signs them off.","failure":"注意干擾：支承滑動面因鹽霧腐蝕或積砂而卡滯，溫度力轉移到墩柱造成裂縫；伸縮縫行程不足時夏季頂死、冬季開口過大，車輛衝擊破壞錨定混凝土並使雨水與鹽分流到支承。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、日照與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Sliding surfaces seized by salt corrosion or trapped sand transfer thermal forces into the piers and crack them; joints with too little travel close up in summer and gape in winter, and traffic impact breaks the anchoring concrete and lets water and salt reach the bearings. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, sunshine and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"竣工時記錄每道伸縮縫開口與當時梁溫；營運後在不同季節重測，繪出開口與溫度的關係，斜率應接近 α·L，若偏離或出現持續漂移，代表支承卡滯或墩柱位移。支承檢查滑動面磨耗、錨栓與防塵罩。","textEn":"Record every joint opening with girder temperature at completion; re-measure in different seasons and plot opening against temperature, whose slope should approach α·L, while deviation or steady drift signals seized bearings or pier movement. Inspect bearing sliding surfaces for wear, anchor bolts and dust covers.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接清冊應包含伸縮縫與支承的型號、行程、初始設定與溫度、更換程序與交通維持計畫，以及索力基準與載重試驗資料；並約定巡查週期與颱風、地震後的特別檢查表，明訂由哪個單位簽認。","textEn":"The handover register should list joint and bearing types, travel, initial settings and temperatures, replacement procedures and traffic-management plans, together with the stay-force baseline and load-test data; it should also fix inspection intervals and special post-typhoon and post-earthquake checklists, naming who signs them off.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「伸縮縫、支承與營運交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Joints, bearings and operational handover\"?","options":["竣工時記錄每道伸縮縫開口與當時梁溫；營運後在不同季節重測，繪出開口與溫度的關係，斜率應接近 α·L，若偏離或出現持續漂移，代表支承卡滯或墩柱位移。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","只要量到索的頻率，就能用同一個公式精確換算任何長度的索力。"],"optionsEn":["Record every joint opening with girder temperature at completion.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Once a stay's frequency is measured, one formula gives an exact force for any stay length."],"answer":0,"explanation":"竣工時記錄每道伸縮縫開口與當時梁溫；營運後在不同季節重測，繪出開口與溫度的關係，斜率應接近 α·L，若偏離或出現持續漂移，代表支承卡滯或墩柱位移。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Record every joint opening with girder temperature at completion; re-measure in different seasons and plot opening against temperature, whose slope should approach α·L, while deviation or steady drift signals seized bearings or pier movement. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b002-v13-40","title":"伸縮縫、支承與營運交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Joints, bearings and operational handover: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"prerequisiteIds":["b002-v13-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「伸縮縫與支承行程」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Joint and bearing travel” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"支承滑動面因鹽霧腐蝕或積砂而卡滯，溫度力轉移到墩柱造成裂縫；伸縮縫行程不足時夏季頂死、冬季開口過大，車輛衝擊破壞錨定混凝土並使雨水與鹽分流到支承。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Sliding surfaces seized by salt corrosion or trapped sand transfer thermal forces into the piers and crack them; joints with too little travel close up in summer and gape in winter, and traffic impact breaks the anchoring concrete and lets water and salt reach the bearings. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：交接時管理單位需要的不只是竣工圖，還包括各單元固定點位置、支承與伸縮縫設計行程、竣工時的初始開口與當時溫度，作為日後判斷異常位移的基準；公開報導也提到通車後將依強風情況實施交通管制。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: At handover the operator needs more than as-built drawings: the fixed point of each unit, design travel of bearings and joints, and the initial joint openings with the temperature at completion, as the baseline for spotting abnormal movement; public reports also note traffic control during strong winds after opening.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「伸縮縫只是行車舒適性的配件，損壞時不影響結構。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Expansion joints only affect ride comfort, so their damage does not matter structurally.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b002-v13-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"支承滑動面因鹽霧腐蝕或積砂而卡滯，溫度力轉移到墩柱造成裂縫；伸縮縫行程不足時夏季頂死、冬季開口過大，車輛衝擊破壞錨定混凝土並使雨水與鹽分流到支承。","textEn":"Sliding surfaces seized by salt corrosion or trapped sand transfer thermal forces into the piers and crack them; joints with too little travel close up in summer and gape in winter, and traffic impact breaks the anchoring concrete and lets water and salt reach the bearings.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]},{"id":"b002-v13-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「伸縮縫、支承與營運交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Joints, bearings and operational handover\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","支承滑動面因鹽霧腐蝕或積砂而卡滯，溫度力轉移到墩柱造成裂縫；伸縮縫行程不足時夏季頂死、冬季開口過大，車輛衝擊破壞錨定混凝土並使雨水與鹽分流到支承。","海上橋梁的基礎設計只要考慮完工後的營運荷載就足夠。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Sliding surfaces seized by salt corrosion or trapped sand transfer thermal forces into the piers and crack them.","Designing a marine bridge foundation only needs the in-service loads of the finished bridge."],"answer":1,"explanation":"支承滑動面因鹽霧腐蝕或積砂而卡滯，溫度力轉移到墩柱造成裂縫；伸縮縫行程不足時夏季頂死、冬季開口過大，車輛衝擊破壞錨定混凝土並使雨水與鹽分流到支承。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Sliding surfaces seized by salt corrosion or trapped sand transfer thermal forces into the piers and crack them; joints with too little travel close up in summer and gape in winter, and traffic impact breaks the anchoring concrete and lets water and salt reach the bearings. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["v13s-ey-kinmen-bridge-progress","v13s-cy-kinmen-bridge-audit","v13s-nat-report-sea-bridge-study","v13s-newslens-kinmen-bridge","v13s-ctee-kinmen-bridge-irf"],"curriculumVersion":13,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
